window.NMS_I18N={"en":{"kb8849040":"Choose a planet and you come down into it flying, behind the ship, over the same ground you walk on: seas, sand, grass, trees, hills and peaks in 3D.","kb09c738b":"turn","k92b63208":"speed","kdc6a27fe":"OCT− held","kf7d80df0":"boost","kc61673a7":"OCT+ held","ka7fc8274":"land on land: a tree under the ship blows to pixels, then you walk. Over water it refuses","k986c0f88":"turned down: back to space","kcfb32465":"Over a planet: fly at top speed for a moment and four ships come up beside you. First through the six beams of light wins credits.","k56e3bd35":"In that race, hold OCT+ over land to land for a moment while the others fly on. Hold it again to fly.","kab0d0977":"In space: a ship with a chequered flag shows up now and then, when you stand still or ahead of you. Hold OCT+ by it for the road race, then you are back in space.","ked1cc0e2":"Inspired by Galactic Racer, reduced to what fits on the FM-1. The race flags on planets, the gates at stations and the neon space race are gone: the room went to the new ones.","k02e264ad":"Every time a sound changes, the sounds show as CDs in a 3D carousel, with each one’s name on it: the new one rolls in, turns round and spins, and the screen goes back to where you were.","k0b3564fb":"on HOME, on the PRESETS page, in TRACKS","k9646b430":"on the PRESETS page","kfc0aebc8":"drum kit","k8a2329ac":"on the drum track","k2a8131c7":"From the tapes of winampFM: the same 42 colour sets and the same way of making the art, on discs.","kc7ae3fa6":"SLOOP 2.8.4: more stable MIDI clock, resonance on every track filter, a filter on the drums, cleaner fades, UNISON and PHYS fixes, SAMPLE and GRAIN follow the top keys, a sturdier second core, more reliable rescue.","k121ef6a0":"FX > PARTY (from winampFM): who is on stage. Solo, duel, trio or all, a lead, and the stage can turn by itself every 1, 2, 4 or 8 bars.","k212569d7":"ARP 2 > ORD SCL (from winampFM): one key plays the whole scale, two keys the scale between them. With HOLD on, the same note again stops it.","k4edd58b9":"EDIT > WAVE, a mini sample editor (after the ½ sampler): the wave on the whole screen with IN, OUT, LOOP and TUNE on the knobs.","k7ffaedeb":"Menu > SEQ: STEP ADVANCE, DRUM PREVIEW and FILTER RESO.","k9f2541ea":"To make room, BASS, hats and cymbals went from 22 to 16 kHz and SCRATCH to 11 kHz. No sound was removed.","k09955c94":"The No Man Sky FM editor: the SLOOP editor by isod89 with our name and colours. Songs, sounds, piano roll, MIDI and backups from the computer.","k9cb995c1":"The whole simulator on this page: the 3D model, the screen pixel for pixel and the controls side by side.","k2510c70d":"Six languages: English, Portuguese, Korean, Japanese, German and French.","k06ace978":"The planet in 3D","k9af3f864":"Races","k82510ca3":"CDs","kb4e3efeb":"Sound","k9629fc86":"Editor and site","k62cf05b6":"turn the ship","kf5e2b043":"zoom: wide, near, close-up, cabin","k3a96d969":"the selected track’s volume","k4d8edb7c":"the tempo","k0bd7625b":"boost (1.2 s: pulse jump)","kb716a492":"auto boost (another click: off)","kad5ceaf9":"enter a planet · dock · race the flag ship","k33b2ad58":"the warp map","k87c70a0b":"radar","k4823aacf":"HOME held","k1dff73ec":"the menu","k73dad583":"speed (at the top for a moment: a race)","k5a64c49b":"land (in a race, again: fly)","kdf06b147":"walk","kea567fff":"run · standing still: call the ship","k8e7ca96b":"laser (let go: collect) · take off by the ship","k85eaed4f":"call the ship","ka9ccbb94":"who is on stage","kfdb309c6":"the mini sample editor","k88dd24ae":"SCL: the scale from one or two keys","k7dd888f2":"STEP ADVANCE, DRUM PREVIEW, FILTER RESO","kcd92dc96":"the light a key makes: waves, rain, comet, fireworks","k8de073a2":"a drum’s TUNE and DECAY","k66adecc9":"QUANT ON / OFF: record off the grid","k59d4f603":"In space","k3ed10c21":"Over a planet","k39c7937a":"On foot","k97f44890":"New screens","ke27f466b":"A space adventure","k4576054d":"Switch the FM-1 on: your ship flies in over the stars, with its own synthwave theme. Any button skips it.","k975b6b23":"power on","k2b8e1848":"the opening, then the game","kb093ecac":"Fly between planets","k77256c5f":"The nearest planets wait at the edge of the screen with their distance in light-years. Every one is different: colours, seas, hills, rings.","kecee81ec":"turn, speed","k5954d15d":"boost, then the pulse jump","k2803a730":"Zoom in, then step inside","k43306160":"Zoom in to your ship among long trails of light, and once more to sit in its cabin.","k4430b15c":"wide · near · close-up · cabin","kc2f4739c":"Warp to other stars","k07fcf2e1":"Open the galactic map, pick a system and jump: a tunnel of light, then new planets.","kc0fa4797":"the map","k271e9a56":"jump","k60c56c36":"Calm flight","k8a247bf7":"Set the auto boost, start a soft loop, and just fly.","k9aa61141":"auto boost on / off","k5e0b5619":"Into the planet","kb31ea7af":"Fly close until the dotted ring blinks and hold OCT+: you come down flying over its ground, in 3D.","k7906058d":"enter, then land","k7bf66fa8":"Robots, laser, loot","ka5eed2eb":"Walk, mine with the laser and fight the sentinels: three hits and they blow up. Some planets are hostile and shoot back.","k71f8a623":"the laser (let go: collect)","k8cb31094":"Call your ship, take off","kd5011982":"The ship comes down beside you. By it, hold OCT+: a pixel-art film carries you through the clouds back to space.","k7c0ed89a":"take off","kc42a2f1c":"They follow you","k8ea7fd1b":"The robots you fought come after you into space as red ships. Boost hard enough and you lose them.","k9bdf185f":"boost away","kbe41101b":"Race over the planet","k5d8a5c15":"At top speed four ships join you: six beams of light, credits for the place you finish in.","k3333c386":"to the top","k56b2d3e1":"The ship with a flag","ke208b11a":"Now and then a racer waits in space. Hold OCT+ by it for the road race, and after it you are back where you were.","kde4bedce":"race","ke1df3f25":"Make the soundtrack","kda37506e":"Everything of SLOOP is there: loops, steps, drums, effects. All of it while the journey goes on.","kc13440a0":"record a loop","ka9e6fa99":"SEQ held + keys","k6578912e":"steps","k5b1626c3":"FX held + key","k55ab2cbb":"a performance effect","k1923752a":"Sounds as CDs","k687533d1":"Change a sound and its CD rolls in with its name on it.","kfb866fad":"change the sound","k1b7d7165":"Every screen over the game","kd114ea44":"Pages, layers, REC, the menu: the game stays behind them, through a dark mesh of pixels.","k98e91f6d":"any page","k7cbe8abe":"the game behind","kf6d700f5":"Flight","kef23509a":"Planets","k60384fa6":"Fights and races","k131260cb":"Music","kcbc8b5aa":"The planet in 3D, new races, CDs, SLOOP 2.8.4. Released.","kb346d4c1":"Flight over each planet in 3D, on the ground you walk on; landing on land, trees that blow to pixels","kd883b9b4":"Race over the planet with four rivals and six beams; a ship with a flag starts the road race in space","k9c33822b":"CDs on every sound change (after the tapes of winampFM)","k69e0b472":"Merged SLOOP 2.8.4 by isod89","kaa246f80":"PARTY and the scale arpeggio (from winampFM)","k1d9920a3":"Screens over the game much lighter: only what changes goes to the LCD","k66857ce2":"The editor on the site, the whole simulator, six languages","k0fc1909a":"Removed to make room: race flags on planets, station gates, the neon space race. Lower sample rates on BASS, hats, cymbals and SCRATCH","kbc6101e6":"Test builds, never released.","k8cc090e9":"EDIT > WAVE, the mini sample editor (after the ½ sampler)","k2303fd3b":"A strip that says what the four knobs do, for two seconds after a turn","k7cbfd71f":"Dots that show the page you are on","kcfd9dc35":"Colours of each track in the visuals","ka9feadb0":"The galaxy got busier.","kcfa1d2fa":"Battles out in space: a boss that fires bursts and goes down in 30 s, little ships that keep coming","kba483788":"Pirates raid the system now and then: 2 to 6 ships","k0534a559":"Hold keys to call escorts: little white ships with long trails","ka64eda06":"Races on planets and on a neon road in space, with gears and a pixel dashboard","kb602be8b":"A hangar in every station: five ships, engine and weapon upgrades","k7ddb9617":"People on some planets with quests, ships passing by that talk to you","k9b6081cd":"REC keeps the arp and the punch-in FX, saved with the project","kf79e460b":"A new take-off and close-up drawn from a 3D model of the ship","k7bf542e0":"First public version: site, installer, simulator.","kc3db383f":"Merged SLOOP 2.7.1: the sound on both cores, 15 arp modes, KBD HOLD, MIDI 3, SAVE SECTION A–D, favourite sounds, REC QUANT off, looping user samples, knob acceleration, USB audio rate","kd402a7c9":"KEY LED: the light a key makes (from winampFM)","k912e556d":"GLO > DRUM SOUND: a drum’s TUNE and DECAY","ke89ae343":"The opening with its own music; a nebula behind the stars; rings around planets","kd95bd2f5":"A galaxy to travel.","k96aba26f":"Galactic map, warp, stations, trade, fuel and saved games","kd712bf1a":"Sentinels on planets, laser combat, hostile planets, pursuit into space","k4f34c665":"Boost, pulse jump, auto boost, radar, close-up, cabin","k897fc7a2":"Visuals behind the knobs you turn; take-off and warp films","k147e5d86":"The game on HOME.","k8adacd22":"A space game on HOME, inspired by Low Mem Sky (PICO-8) and No Man’s Sky: stars, globe planets, landing, walking, resources, creatures, scanner","k1b0aa9c3":"Four colours over black and white; pixel textures instead of inverted text","kc767dde1":"The base.","k8064f8c8":"Built on SLOOP 2.6 by isod89 (based on Felucca by Leo Kuroshita): the same sound and buttons","k08d8c5e5":"New screens: black and white, numbers and bars only","kc7e9fb2e":"Editor","k77e39fce":"<b>Real-life side quests</b><br>My personal space to share the progress of my technology studies: learning synths, improvements and tests with No Man Sky FM, winampFM and FM1 Quest, and robotics prototypes with ESP32.","k31168e75":"<b>Demos and updates</b><br>Videos of No Man Sky FM, winampFM and FM1 Quest updates in action, development guides so more people can create with their own creativity, and some behind the scenes.","k36970242":"What’s new","k5d12bd53":"Play","kbee75ca7":"Controls","kfc338f87":"Features","ka239107e":"Versions","k14e8617e":"Install help","kcf04a7f5":"No Man Sky FM for your FM-1","ked4318b7":"A free firmware for the M-VAVE FM-1: a space adventure you play with two knobs while the other hand makes the music. Fly over planets, race, mine, fight, warp between stars.","ka16e30a0":"based on SLOOP 2.8.4","kcce2664d":"Download the firmware file","kcd5af734":"Release notes","kaeaf06e3":"Open the editor","kb3782d9b":"New in v0.9","k30a2439c":"Still being optimized.","k2ea97e86":"This version brings a lot at once, so the 3D flight and some screens can still lose frames, and more optimization is coming in the next versions. Keep a backup, and tell us what feels slow.","kb23035c2":"All the music in the video was made live on the FM-1, while playing the game. Filmed on an earlier version.","k9856dddb":"Play it here","k64312600":"The real firmware in your browser. Click the screen to switch it on, then use the knobs, the buttons or your computer keyboard.","k4e787811":"The controls","ka38197a6":"On HOME the FM-1 is the game.","kd1752358":"A quick press keeps the usual function.","k66647c2c":"Only holding, double tapping or pressing together does something new: tapped once, OCT− and OCT+ still change the octave, and every other button does what it always did on SLOOP.","kca032b58":"What it does","kd93e1cee":"Each clip is the real screen.","k7d0a579d":"Every version","ke2e004bd":"What came in each one.","ke29b98d8":"Installing: details","k77340732":"Hold OCT− alone while switching the FM-1 on for the USB rescue.","k99b506be":"Install log","k2f388ccb":"No Man Sky FM is based on SLOOP 2.8.4 by isod89, which is based on Felucca by Leo Kuroshita (Hügelton Instruments). GPL-3.0. Tapes, PARTY, the scale arpeggio and KEY LED come from winampFM; the sample editor follows the ½ sampler; the game is inspired by Low Mem Sky (PICO-8).","k6d21d709":"The source of the whole firmware is open: use the features in your own work, just credit No Man Sky FM in your README or video.","kba54bb5f":"A fan-made demake inspired by No Man’s Sky. Not affiliated with Hello Games or M-VAVE. M-VAVE and FM-1 are trademarks of their respective owners.","k7807532a":"Cookies and statistics (Google Analytics)","kcd39008a":"This site uses cookies only for Google Analytics (counting visits and clicks). Nothing is used for ads.","kbb54db51":"Accept","kb59cf9ed":"Decline","k273757aa":"No Man Sky FM · a space adventure for the M-VAVE FM-1","kc8675119":"No Man Sky FM: a free, experimental firmware for the M-VAVE FM-1. Fly over planets in 3D, race, land, mine, fight, warp between stars, and make the soundtrack of your journey.","s_title":"simulator · the real firmware (WebAssembly)","s_on":"power on","s_snd":"sound","s_reset":"reset memory","s_hint":"Click the screen to power on. Fly with KNOB 1 and 2, hold OCT+ to land, play the keys to make the soundtrack.","s_scr":"The screen, pixel for pixel","s_scrn":"The same picture as on the model’s glass: what the firmware draws on the 240×240 LCD.","s_how":"How to play","s_k12":"turn the ship · speed (on a planet: walk)","s_a":"boost · on a planet: run (standing still: call the ship)","s_b":"enter a planet · land · laser · take off by the ship","s_map":"the warp map","s_oct":"the octave, as always","s_k34":"zoom (to the close-up and the cabin) · the track’s volume","s_home":"radar · HOME held: on a planet the ship, in space the menu","s_play":"the music","s_keys":"play notes","s_held":"Right click (or Shift+click) a button of the model to keep it held.","s_clk":"CLICK TO POWER ON","s_pow":"POWERING ON…","s_ask":"Erase the simulator memory and restart?","s_noM":"no MIDI device found","s_arw":"arrows ↑↓ turn","s_ohd":"OCT− held","s_bhd":"OCT+ held","s_ock":"OCT click","s_kk":"keys"},"pt":{"kb8849040":"Escolha um planeta e você entra nele voando, atrás da nave, sobre o mesmo chão em que anda: mares, areia, grama, árvores, morros e picos em 3D.","kb09c738b":"vira","k92b63208":"velocidade","kdc6a27fe":"OCT− segurado","kf7d80df0":"boost","kc61673a7":"OCT+ segurado","ka7fc8274":"pousa em terra: uma árvore embaixo da nave explode em pixels e você sai andando. Sobre a água ela recusa","k986c0f88":"girado para baixo: volta ao espaço","kcfb32465":"Sobre um planeta: voe na velocidade máxima por um instante e quatro naves chegam do seu lado. Quem passa primeiro pelos seis feixes de luz ganha créditos.","k56e3bd35":"Nessa corrida, segure OCT+ sobre terra para pousar um instante enquanto os outros seguem. Segure de novo para voar.","kab0d0977":"No espaço: uma nave com bandeira quadriculada aparece de vez em quando, se você fica parado ou à sua frente. Segure OCT+ perto dela para a corrida da estrada; no fim, você volta ao espaço.","ked1cc0e2":"Inspirado em Galactic Racer, reduzido ao que cabe no FM-1. As bandeiras nos planetas, os portões das estações e a corrida neon no espaço saíram: o espaço foi para as novas.","k02e264ad":"Sempre que um som muda, os sons aparecem como CDs num carrossel 3D, cada um com o seu nome: o novo entra rolando, dá uma volta e gira, e a tela volta para onde você estava.","k0b3564fb":"na HOME, na página PRESETS, em TRACKS","k9646b430":"na página PRESETS","kfc0aebc8":"kit de bateria","k8a2329ac":"na faixa de bateria","k2a8131c7":"Vem das fitas do winampFM: as mesmas 42 combinações de cores e o mesmo jeito de fazer a arte, em discos.","kc7ae3fa6":"SLOOP 2.8.4: clock MIDI mais estável, ressonância em todo filtro de faixa, filtro na bateria, fades mais limpos, correções em UNISON e PHYS, SAMPLE e GRAIN seguem as teclas de cima, segundo núcleo mais robusto, resgate mais confiável.","k121ef6a0":"FX > PARTY (do winampFM): quem está no palco. Solo, duelo, trio ou todos, um líder, e o palco pode girar sozinho a cada 1, 2, 4 ou 8 compassos.","k212569d7":"ARP 2 > ORD SCL (do winampFM): uma tecla toca a escala inteira, duas tocam a escala entre elas. Com HOLD ligado, a mesma nota de novo para.","k4edd58b9":"EDIT > WAVE, um mini editor de sample (a partir do ½ sampler): a onda na tela inteira com IN, OUT, LOOP e TUNE nos knobs.","k7ffaedeb":"Menu > SEQ: STEP ADVANCE, DRUM PREVIEW e FILTER RESO.","k9f2541ea":"Para abrir espaço, BASS, chimbais e pratos foram de 22 para 16 kHz e o SCRATCH para 11 kHz. Nenhum som foi removido.","k09955c94":"O editor do No Man Sky FM: o editor do SLOOP, de isod89, com o nosso nome e cores. Músicas, sons, piano roll, MIDI e backups pelo computador.","k9cb995c1":"O simulador inteiro nesta página: o modelo 3D, a tela pixel por pixel e os comandos lado a lado.","k2510c70d":"Seis idiomas: inglês, português, coreano, japonês, alemão e francês.","k06ace978":"O planeta em 3D","k9af3f864":"Corridas","k82510ca3":"CDs","kb4e3efeb":"Som","k9629fc86":"Editor e site","k62cf05b6":"vira a nave","kf5e2b043":"zoom: longe, perto, close-up, cabine","k3a96d969":"o volume da faixa selecionada","k4d8edb7c":"o tempo","k0bd7625b":"boost (1,2 s: pulse jump)","kb716a492":"auto boost (outro clique: desliga)","kad5ceaf9":"entra num planeta · atraca · corre contra a nave com bandeira","k33b2ad58":"o mapa do warp","k87c70a0b":"radar","k4823aacf":"HOME segurado","k1dff73ec":"o menu","k73dad583":"velocidade (no máximo por um instante: corrida)","k5a64c49b":"pousa (na corrida, de novo: voa)","kdf06b147":"anda","kea567fff":"corre · parado: chama a nave","k8e7ca96b":"laser (soltar: coleta) · decola perto da nave","k85eaed4f":"chama a nave","ka9ccbb94":"quem está no palco","kfdb309c6":"o mini editor de sample","k88dd24ae":"SCL: a escala a partir de uma ou duas teclas","k7dd888f2":"STEP ADVANCE, DRUM PREVIEW, FILTER RESO","kcd92dc96":"a luz que uma tecla faz: waves, rain, comet, fireworks","k8de073a2":"TUNE e DECAY de cada som da bateria","k66adecc9":"QUANT ON / OFF: grava fora da grade","k59d4f603":"No espaço","k3ed10c21":"Sobre o planeta","k39c7937a":"A pé","k97f44890":"Telas novas","ke27f466b":"Uma aventura espacial","k4576054d":"Ligue o FM-1: sua nave entra voando pelas estrelas, com um tema synthwave próprio. Qualquer botão pula.","k975b6b23":"ligar","k2b8e1848":"a abertura, depois o jogo","kb093ecac":"Voe entre planetas","k77256c5f":"Os planetas mais perto esperam na borda da tela com a distância em anos-luz. Cada um é diferente: cores, mares, morros, anéis.","kecee81ec":"vira, velocidade","k5954d15d":"boost, depois o pulse jump","k2803a730":"Zoom, e depois para dentro","k43306160":"Dê zoom na nave entre rastros longos de luz e mais uma vez para sentar na cabine.","k4430b15c":"longe · perto · close-up · cabine","kc2f4739c":"Salte para outras estrelas","k07fcf2e1":"Abra o mapa galáctico, escolha um sistema e salte: um túnel de luz, depois planetas novos.","kc0fa4797":"o mapa","k271e9a56":"salta","k60c56c36":"Voo tranquilo","k8a247bf7":"Ligue o auto boost, comece um loop suave e só voe.","k9aa61141":"auto boost liga / desliga","k5e0b5619":"Para dentro do planeta","kb31ea7af":"Chegue perto até o anel pontilhado piscar e segure OCT+: você desce voando sobre o chão dele, em 3D.","k7906058d":"entra, depois pousa","k7bf66fa8":"Robôs, laser, recursos","ka5eed2eb":"Ande, minere com o laser e enfrente as sentinelas: três tiros e explodem. Alguns planetas são hostis e atiram de volta.","k71f8a623":"o laser (soltar: coleta)","k8cb31094":"Chame a nave, decole","kd5011982":"A nave desce do seu lado. Perto dela, segure OCT+: um filme em pixel art te leva pelas nuvens de volta ao espaço.","k7c0ed89a":"decola","kc42a2f1c":"Eles te seguem","k8ea7fd1b":"Os robôs que você enfrentou vêm atrás de você no espaço, como naves vermelhas. Acelere forte e você despista.","k9bdf185f":"foge no boost","kbe41101b":"Corrida sobre o planeta","k5d8a5c15":"Na velocidade máxima, quatro naves se juntam a você: seis feixes de luz e créditos pela sua colocação.","k3333c386":"no máximo","k56b2d3e1":"A nave com bandeira","ke208b11a":"De vez em quando uma nave de corrida espera no espaço. Segure OCT+ perto dela para a corrida da estrada; depois você volta para onde estava.","kde4bedce":"corre","ke1df3f25":"Faça a trilha sonora","kda37506e":"Todo o SLOOP está lá: loops, passos, bateria, efeitos. Tudo enquanto a viagem continua.","kc13440a0":"grava um loop","ka9e6fa99":"SEQ segurado + teclas","k6578912e":"passos","k5b1626c3":"FX segurado + tecla","k55ab2cbb":"um efeito de performance","k1923752a":"Sons como CDs","k687533d1":"Troque um som e o CD dele entra rolando, com o nome.","kfb866fad":"troca o som","k1b7d7165":"Toda tela sobre o jogo","kd114ea44":"Páginas, camadas, REC, o menu: o jogo fica por trás deles, numa malha escura de pixels.","k98e91f6d":"qualquer página","k7cbe8abe":"o jogo por trás","kf6d700f5":"Voo","kef23509a":"Planetas","k60384fa6":"Lutas e corridas","k131260cb":"Música","kcbc8b5aa":"O planeta em 3D, corridas novas, CDs, SLOOP 2.8.4. Lançada.","kb346d4c1":"Voo em 3D sobre cada planeta, no chão em que você anda; pouso em terra, árvores que explodem em pixels","kd883b9b4":"Corrida sobre o planeta com quatro rivais e seis feixes; uma nave com bandeira começa a corrida da estrada no espaço","k9c33822b":"CDs em toda troca de som (a partir das fitas do winampFM)","k69e0b472":"Merge do SLOOP 2.8.4, de isod89","kaa246f80":"PARTY e o arpejo de escala (do winampFM)","k1d9920a3":"Telas sobre o jogo bem mais leves: só o que muda vai para o LCD","k66857ce2":"O editor no site, o simulador inteiro, seis idiomas","k0fc1909a":"Removido para abrir espaço: bandeiras de corrida nos planetas, portões das estações, a corrida neon no espaço. Taxa menor em BASS, chimbais, pratos e SCRATCH","kbc6101e6":"Versões de teste, nunca lançadas.","k8cc090e9":"EDIT > WAVE, o mini editor de sample (a partir do ½ sampler)","k2303fd3b":"Uma faixa que diz o que os quatro knobs fazem, por dois segundos depois de girar","k7cbfd71f":"Pontos que mostram a página em que você está","kcfd9dc35":"Cores de cada faixa nos visuais","ka9feadb0":"A galáxia ficou mais movimentada.","kcfa1d2fa":"Batalhas no espaço: um chefão que dispara rajadas e cai em 30 s, naves menores que não param de chegar","kba483788":"Piratas invadem o sistema de vez em quando: de 2 a 6 naves","k0534a559":"Segure teclas para chamar escoltas: naves brancas pequenas com rastros longos","ka64eda06":"Corridas nos planetas e numa estrada neon no espaço, com marchas e painel em pixel","kb602be8b":"Um hangar em cada estação: cinco naves, upgrades de motor e arma","k7ddb9617":"Personagens em alguns planetas com missões, naves que passam e conversam com você","k9b6081cd":"O REC grava o arp e os FX de punch-in, salvos junto com o projeto","kf79e460b":"Nova decolagem e close-up desenhados a partir de um modelo 3D da nave","k7bf542e0":"Primeira versão pública: site, instalador, simulador.","kc3db383f":"Merge do SLOOP 2.7.1: som nos dois núcleos, 15 modos de arp, KBD HOLD, MIDI 3, SAVE SECTION A–D, sons favoritos, REC QUANT off, samples do usuário em loop, aceleração dos knobs, taxa do áudio USB","kd402a7c9":"KEY LED: a luz que uma tecla faz (do winampFM)","k912e556d":"GLO > DRUM SOUND: TUNE e DECAY de cada som da bateria","ke89ae343":"A abertura com música própria; uma nebulosa atrás das estrelas; anéis nos planetas","kd95bd2f5":"Uma galáxia para viajar.","k96aba26f":"Mapa galáctico, warp, estações, comércio, combustível e jogo salvo","kd712bf1a":"Sentinelas nos planetas, combate com laser, planetas hostis, perseguição no espaço","k4f34c665":"Boost, pulse jump, auto boost, radar, close-up, cabine","k897fc7a2":"Visuais atrás dos knobs que você gira; filmes de decolagem e warp","k147e5d86":"O jogo na HOME.","k8adacd22":"Um jogo espacial na HOME, inspirado em Low Mem Sky (PICO-8) e No Man’s Sky: estrelas, planetas em globo, pouso, caminhada, recursos, criaturas, scanner","k1b0aa9c3":"Quatro cores sobre preto e branco; texturas em pixel no lugar de texto invertido","kc767dde1":"A base.","k8064f8c8":"Feito sobre o SLOOP 2.6, de isod89 (baseado no Felucca, de Leo Kuroshita): o mesmo som e os mesmos botões","k08d8c5e5":"Telas novas: preto e branco, só números e barras","kc7e9fb2e":"Editor","k77e39fce":"<b>Side quests da vida real</b><br>Meu espaço pessoal para compartilhar o progresso dos meus estudos de tecnologia: aprendendo synth, melhorias e testes com o No Man Sky FM, o winampFM e o FM1 Quest, e protótipos de robótica com ESP32.","k31168e75":"<b>Demonstrações e atualizações</b><br>Vídeos das atualizações do No Man Sky FM, do winampFM e do FM1 Quest em ação, guias de desenvolvimento para mais gente criar com a própria criatividade, e alguns bastidores.","k36970242":"Novidades","k5d12bd53":"Jogar","kbee75ca7":"Comandos","kfc338f87":"Funções","ka239107e":"Versões","k14e8617e":"Ajuda","kcf04a7f5":"No Man Sky FM para o seu FM-1","ked4318b7":"Um firmware gratuito para o M-VAVE FM-1: uma aventura espacial que você joga com dois knobs enquanto a outra mão faz a música. Voe sobre planetas, corra, minere, lute, salte entre estrelas.","ka16e30a0":"baseado no SLOOP 2.8.4","kcce2664d":"Baixar o arquivo do firmware","kcd5af734":"Notas da versão","kaeaf06e3":"Abrir o editor","kb3782d9b":"Novo na v0.9","k30a2439c":"Ainda em otimização.","k2ea97e86":"Esta versão traz muita coisa de uma vez, então o voo em 3D e algumas telas ainda podem perder quadros, e mais otimizações vêm nas próximas versões. Guarde um backup e conte o que parece lento.","kb23035c2":"Toda a música do vídeo foi feita ao vivo no FM-1, enquanto o jogo era jogado. Filmado numa versão anterior.","k9856dddb":"Jogue aqui","k64312600":"O firmware de verdade no navegador. Clique na tela para ligar e use os knobs, os botões ou o teclado do computador.","k4e787811":"Os comandos","ka38197a6":"Na HOME o FM-1 é o jogo.","kd1752358":"Um toque rápido mantém a função normal.","k66647c2c":"Só segurar, tocar duas vezes ou apertar junto faz algo novo: com um toque, OCT− e OCT+ continuam trocando a oitava, e todo outro botão faz o que sempre fez no SLOOP.","kca032b58":"O que ele faz","kd93e1cee":"Cada clipe é a tela de verdade.","k7d0a579d":"Todas as versões","ke2e004bd":"O que entrou em cada uma.","ke29b98d8":"Instalação: detalhes","k77340732":"Segure só o OCT− ao ligar o FM-1 para o resgate por USB.","k99b506be":"Registro da instalação","k2f388ccb":"O No Man Sky FM é baseado no SLOOP 2.8.4 de isod89, que é baseado no Felucca de Leo Kuroshita (Hügelton Instruments). GPL-3.0. Fitas, PARTY, o arpejo de escala e o KEY LED vêm do winampFM; o editor de sample segue o ½ sampler; o jogo é inspirado em Low Mem Sky (PICO-8).","k6d21d709":"O código do firmware inteiro é aberto: use as funções no seu trabalho, só dê o crédito ao No Man Sky FM no README ou no vídeo.","kba54bb5f":"Um demake feito por fã, inspirado em No Man’s Sky. Sem ligação com a Hello Games ou a M-VAVE. M-VAVE e FM-1 são marcas de seus donos.","k7807532a":"Cookies e estatísticas (Google Analytics)","kcd39008a":"Este site usa cookies apenas para o Google Analytics (contar visitas e cliques). Nada é usado para anúncios.","kbb54db51":"Aceitar","kb59cf9ed":"Recusar","k273757aa":"No Man Sky FM · uma aventura espacial para o M-VAVE FM-1","kc8675119":"No Man Sky FM: um firmware gratuito e experimental para o M-VAVE FM-1. Voe sobre planetas em 3D, corra, pouse, minere, lute, salte entre estrelas e faça a trilha da sua viagem.","s_title":"simulador · o firmware de verdade (WebAssembly)","s_on":"ligar","s_snd":"som","s_reset":"apagar memória","s_hint":"Clique na tela para ligar. Pilote com o KNOB 1 e 2, segure OCT+ para pousar, toque as teclas para fazer a trilha.","s_scr":"A tela, pixel por pixel","s_scrn":"A mesma imagem do vidro do modelo: o que o firmware desenha no LCD de 240×240.","s_how":"Como jogar","s_k12":"vira a nave · velocidade (no planeta: anda)","s_a":"boost · no planeta: corre (parado: chama a nave)","s_b":"entra num planeta · pousa · laser · decola perto da nave","s_map":"o mapa do warp","s_oct":"a oitava, como sempre","s_k34":"zoom (até o close-up e a cabine) · o volume da faixa","s_home":"radar · HOME segurado: no planeta a nave, no espaço o menu","s_play":"a música","s_keys":"toca notas","s_held":"Clique com o botão direito (ou Shift+clique) num botão do modelo para mantê-lo segurado.","s_clk":"CLIQUE PARA LIGAR","s_pow":"LIGANDO…","s_ask":"Apagar a memória do simulador e reiniciar?","s_noM":"nenhum aparelho MIDI","s_arw":"setas ↑↓ giram","s_ohd":"OCT− segurado","s_bhd":"OCT+ segurado","s_ock":"OCT clique","s_kk":"teclas"},"ko":{"kb8849040":"행성을 고르면 우주선 뒤에서 날아 내려가, 걸어 다니는 바로 그 땅 위를 비행합니다. 바다, 모래, 풀, 나무, 언덕과 봉우리까지 3D로 펼쳐집니다.","kb09c738b":"회전","k92b63208":"속도","kdc6a27fe":"OCT− 길게 누름","kf7d80df0":"부스트","kc61673a7":"OCT+ 길게 누름","ka7fc8274":"땅에 착륙: 우주선 아래의 나무가 픽셀로 흩어지고, 이어서 걸어 다닙니다. 물 위에서는 착륙할 수 없습니다","k986c0f88":"아래로 돌리기: 우주로 돌아갑니다","kcfb32465":"행성 위에서 잠깐 최고 속도로 날면 우주선 네 대가 옆으로 올라옵니다. 여섯 개의 빛줄기를 가장 먼저 통과하면 크레딧을 얻습니다.","k56e3bd35":"그 레이스에서 땅 위에 OCT+를 길게 누르면 다른 우주선이 계속 나는 동안 잠시 착륙합니다. 다시 길게 누르면 비행을 이어갑니다.","kab0d0977":"우주에서는 가만히 서 있거나 앞쪽에 체크무늬 깃발을 단 우주선이 가끔 나타납니다. 그 옆에서 OCT+를 길게 누르면 도로 레이스가 시작되고, 끝나면 다시 우주로 돌아옵니다.","ked1cc0e2":"Galactic Racer에서 영감을 받아 FM-1에 들어가는 만큼만 줄였습니다. 행성의 레이스 깃발, 정거장의 게이트, 네온 우주 레이스는 사라졌고, 그 자리는 새 기능이 차지했습니다.","k02e264ad":"사운드가 바뀔 때마다 사운드가 3D 회전목마의 CD로 나타나며 각 CD에 이름이 표시됩니다. 새 CD가 굴러 들어와 돌며 회전하고, 화면은 원래 있던 곳으로 돌아갑니다.","k0b3564fb":"HOME, PRESETS 페이지, TRACKS에서","k9646b430":"PRESETS 페이지에서","kfc0aebc8":"드럼 키트","k8a2329ac":"드럼 트랙에서","k2a8131c7":"winampFM의 테이프에서 가져왔습니다. 같은 42가지 색 조합과 같은 아트 제작 방식을 디스크에 담았습니다.","kc7ae3fa6":"SLOOP 2.8.4: 더 안정적인 MIDI 클럭, 모든 트랙 필터의 레조넌스, 드럼 필터, 더 깔끔한 페이드, UNISON과 PHYS 수정, 상단 키를 따라가는 SAMPLE과 GRAIN, 더 튼튼한 두 번째 코어, 더 믿을 수 있는 복구.","k121ef6a0":"FX > PARTY (winampFM에서): 누가 무대에 서는지 정합니다. 솔로, 듀얼, 트리오 또는 전체, 리드 지정, 그리고 1, 2, 4, 8마디마다 무대가 저절로 바뀝니다.","k212569d7":"ARP 2 > ORD SCL (winampFM에서): 키 하나로 스케일 전체를, 키 두 개로 그 사이의 스케일을 연주합니다. HOLD를 켜면 같은 음을 다시 눌러 멈춥니다.","k4edd58b9":"EDIT > WAVE, 미니 샘플 에디터 (½ sampler 이후): 화면 전체에 파형을 보여 주고 IN, OUT, LOOP, TUNE을 노브로 조절합니다.","k7ffaedeb":"Menu > SEQ: STEP ADVANCE, DRUM PREVIEW, FILTER RESO.","k9f2541ea":"공간을 확보하기 위해 BASS, 하이햇, 심벌은 22kHz에서 16kHz로, SCRATCH는 11kHz로 낮췄습니다. 제거된 사운드는 없습니다.","k09955c94":"No Man Sky FM 에디터: isod89의 SLOOP 에디터에 우리 이름과 색을 입혔습니다. 컴퓨터에서 곡, 사운드, 피아노 롤, MIDI, 백업을 다룹니다.","k9cb995c1":"이 페이지에 시뮬레이터 전체가 들어 있습니다. 3D 모델, 픽셀 단위로 똑같은 화면, 컨트롤을 나란히 보여 줍니다.","k2510c70d":"여섯 가지 언어: 영어, 포르투갈어, 한국어, 일본어, 독일어, 프랑스어.","k06ace978":"3D 행성","k9af3f864":"레이스","k82510ca3":"CD","kb4e3efeb":"사운드","k9629fc86":"에디터와 사이트","k62cf05b6":"우주선 회전","kf5e2b043":"줌: 멀리, 가까이, 클로즈업, 조종석","k3a96d969":"선택한 트랙의 볼륨","k4d8edb7c":"템포","k0bd7625b":"부스트 (1.2초: 펄스 점프)","kb716a492":"자동 부스트 (한 번 더 누르면 끄기)","kad5ceaf9":"행성 진입 · 도킹 · 깃발 우주선과 레이스","k33b2ad58":"워프 지도","k87c70a0b":"레이더","k4823aacf":"HOME 길게 누름","k1dff73ec":"메뉴","k73dad583":"속도 (최고 속도로 잠시 유지: 레이스)","k5a64c49b":"착륙 (레이스 중 다시 누르면: 비행)","kdf06b147":"걷기","kea567fff":"달리기 · 가만히 있을 때: 우주선 호출","k8e7ca96b":"레이저 (놓으면: 수집) · 우주선 옆에서 이륙","k85eaed4f":"우주선 호출","ka9ccbb94":"누가 무대에 서는지","kfdb309c6":"미니 샘플 에디터","k88dd24ae":"SCL: 키 하나 또는 두 개로 만드는 스케일","k7dd888f2":"STEP ADVANCE, DRUM PREVIEW, FILTER RESO","kcd92dc96":"키가 만드는 빛: 파도, 비, 혜성, 불꽃놀이","k8de073a2":"드럼의 TUNE과 DECAY","k66adecc9":"QUANT ON / OFF: 그리드 없이 녹음","k59d4f603":"우주에서","k3ed10c21":"행성 위에서","k39c7937a":"걸어서","k97f44890":"새 화면","ke27f466b":"우주 모험","k4576054d":"FM-1을 켜면 당신의 우주선이 별들 사이를 날아 들어오고, 전용 신스웨이브 테마가 흐릅니다. 아무 버튼이나 누르면 건너뜁니다.","k975b6b23":"전원 켜기","k2b8e1848":"오프닝, 그리고 게임","kb093ecac":"행성 사이를 비행","k77256c5f":"가장 가까운 행성들이 화면 가장자리에서 광년 단위 거리와 함께 기다립니다. 색, 바다, 언덕, 고리까지 모두 다릅니다.","kecee81ec":"회전, 속도","k5954d15d":"부스트, 그다음 펄스 점프","k2803a730":"확대해서 안으로 들어가기","k43306160":"긴 빛의 꼬리 사이에 있는 내 우주선을 확대하고, 한 번 더 확대하면 조종석에 앉습니다.","k4430b15c":"멀리 · 가까이 · 클로즈업 · 조종석","kc2f4739c":"다른 별로 워프","k07fcf2e1":"은하 지도를 열고 성계를 골라 점프하세요. 빛의 터널을 지나면 새로운 행성들이 나타납니다.","kc0fa4797":"지도","k271e9a56":"점프","k60c56c36":"편안한 비행","k8a247bf7":"자동 부스트를 켜고 부드러운 루프를 시작한 다음, 그냥 날아 보세요.","k9aa61141":"자동 부스트 켜기 / 끄기","k5e0b5619":"행성 속으로","kb31ea7af":"점선 고리가 깜박일 때까지 가까이 날아가 OCT+를 길게 누르세요. 행성의 지면 위를 3D로 날아 내려갑니다.","k7906058d":"진입, 그다음 착륙","k7bf66fa8":"로봇, 레이저, 전리품","ka5eed2eb":"걸어 다니며 레이저로 채굴하고 센티널과 싸우세요. 세 번 맞히면 터집니다. 적대적인 행성은 반격하기도 합니다.","k71f8a623":"레이저 (놓으면: 수집)","k8cb31094":"우주선 호출, 이륙","kd5011982":"우주선이 옆으로 내려옵니다. 그 옆에서 OCT+를 길게 누르면 픽셀 아트 영상이 구름을 뚫고 우주로 데려다 줍니다.","k7c0ed89a":"이륙","kc42a2f1c":"쫓아옵니다","k8ea7fd1b":"싸웠던 로봇들이 붉은 우주선이 되어 우주까지 쫓아옵니다. 충분히 세게 부스트하면 따돌릴 수 있습니다.","k9bdf185f":"부스트로 도망","kbe41101b":"행성 위 레이스","k5d8a5c15":"최고 속도에서 우주선 네 대가 합류합니다. 여섯 개의 빛줄기를 지나며 도착 순위에 따라 크레딧을 받습니다.","k3333c386":"최고 속도로","k56b2d3e1":"깃발 달린 우주선","ke208b11a":"우주에는 가끔 레이서가 기다리고 있습니다. 그 옆에서 OCT+를 길게 누르면 도로 레이스가 시작되고, 끝나면 원래 있던 곳으로 돌아옵니다.","kde4bedce":"레이스","ke1df3f25":"사운드트랙 만들기","kda37506e":"SLOOP의 모든 기능이 그대로 있습니다. 루프, 스텝, 드럼, 이펙트까지. 여정이 계속되는 동안 전부 쓸 수 있습니다.","kc13440a0":"루프 녹음","ka9e6fa99":"SEQ 길게 누름 + 키","k6578912e":"스텝","k5b1626c3":"FX 길게 누름 + 키","k55ab2cbb":"퍼포먼스 이펙트","k1923752a":"CD가 된 사운드","k687533d1":"사운드를 바꾸면 이름이 적힌 CD가 굴러 들어옵니다.","kfb866fad":"사운드 바꾸기","k1b7d7165":"게임 위에 모든 화면","kd114ea44":"페이지, 레이어, REC, 메뉴: 게임은 어두운 픽셀 메시 너머로 그대로 뒤에 남아 있습니다.","k98e91f6d":"아무 페이지","k7cbe8abe":"뒤에 보이는 게임","kf6d700f5":"비행","kef23509a":"행성","k60384fa6":"전투와 레이스","k131260cb":"음악","kcbc8b5aa":"3D 행성, 새로운 레이스, CD, SLOOP 2.8.4. 출시되었습니다.","kb346d4c1":"각 행성 위를 걸어 다니는 지면 위에서 3D로 비행. 땅에 착륙하고, 나무가 픽셀로 흩어집니다","kd883b9b4":"라이벌 네 명과 빛줄기 여섯 개의 행성 위 레이스. 깃발 우주선이 우주에서 도로 레이스를 시작합니다","k9c33822b":"사운드가 바뀔 때마다 CD (winampFM의 테이프 이후)","k69e0b472":"isod89의 SLOOP 2.8.4 병합","kaa246f80":"PARTY와 스케일 아르페지오 (winampFM에서)","k1d9920a3":"게임 위 화면이 훨씬 가벼워짐: 바뀌는 부분만 LCD로 전송","k66857ce2":"사이트의 에디터, 시뮬레이터 전체, 여섯 가지 언어","k0fc1909a":"공간 확보를 위해 제거: 행성의 레이스 깃발, 정거장 게이트, 네온 우주 레이스. BASS, 하이햇, 심벌, SCRATCH의 샘플레이트 낮춤","kbc6101e6":"테스트 빌드이며 정식 출시되지 않았습니다.","k8cc090e9":"EDIT > WAVE, 미니 샘플 에디터 (½ sampler 이후)","k2303fd3b":"노브를 돌린 뒤 2초 동안 네 노브의 기능을 알려 주는 띠","k7cbfd71f":"현재 페이지를 알려 주는 점","kcfd9dc35":"비주얼에서 트랙마다 다른 색","ka9feadb0":"은하가 더 북적이게 되었습니다.","kcfa1d2fa":"우주 전투: 연속 사격을 하다 30초 만에 쓰러지는 보스, 계속 몰려오는 작은 우주선","kba483788":"해적이 가끔 성계를 습격합니다: 우주선 2~6대","k0534a559":"키를 길게 눌러 호위함 호출: 긴 꼬리를 단 작은 흰색 우주선","ka64eda06":"행성과 우주의 네온 도로에서 레이스, 기어와 픽셀 대시보드","kb602be8b":"모든 정거장에 격납고: 우주선 다섯 종, 엔진과 무기 업그레이드","k7ddb9617":"일부 행성에는 퀘스트를 주는 사람들, 지나가며 말을 거는 우주선","k9b6081cd":"REC가 아르페지오와 펀치인 FX를 유지하고 프로젝트와 함께 저장","kf79e460b":"우주선 3D 모델로 그린 새로운 이륙과 클로즈업","k7bf542e0":"첫 공개 버전: 사이트, 설치 프로그램, 시뮬레이터.","kc3db383f":"SLOOP 2.7.1 병합: 두 코어에서 나는 사운드, 아르페지오 모드 15개, KBD HOLD, MIDI 3, SAVE SECTION A–D, 즐겨찾기 사운드, REC QUANT 끄기, 루프되는 사용자 샘플, 노브 가속, USB 오디오 레이트","kd402a7c9":"KEY LED: 키가 만드는 빛 (winampFM에서)","k912e556d":"GLO > DRUM SOUND: 드럼의 TUNE과 DECAY","ke89ae343":"전용 음악이 흐르는 오프닝, 별 뒤의 성운, 행성 둘레의 고리","kd95bd2f5":"여행할 은하.","k96aba26f":"은하 지도, 워프, 정거장, 거래, 연료, 저장된 게임","kd712bf1a":"행성의 센티널, 레이저 전투, 적대 행성, 우주까지 이어지는 추격","k4f34c665":"부스트, 펄스 점프, 자동 부스트, 레이더, 클로즈업, 조종석","k897fc7a2":"돌리는 노브 뒤에 비주얼, 이륙과 워프 영상","k147e5d86":"HOME의 게임.","k8adacd22":"HOME의 우주 게임. Low Mem Sky (PICO-8)와 No Man’s Sky에서 영감을 받았습니다: 별, 구형 행성, 착륙, 걷기, 자원, 생물, 스캐너","k1b0aa9c3":"흑백 위에 네 가지 색, 반전된 글자 대신 픽셀 질감","kc767dde1":"기반.","k8064f8c8":"isod89의 SLOOP 2.6 (Leo Kuroshita의 Felucca 기반) 위에 제작: 같은 사운드와 버튼","k08d8c5e5":"새 화면: 흑백, 숫자와 막대만","kc7e9fb2e":"에디터","k77e39fce":"<b>현실 속 사이드 퀘스트</b><br>기술 공부의 진행 과정을 공유하는 개인 공간입니다. 신디사이저 배우기, No Man Sky FM, winampFM, FM1 Quest 개선과 테스트, ESP32 로봇 프로토타입을 다룹니다.","k31168e75":"<b>데모와 업데이트</b><br>No Man Sky FM, winampFM, FM1 Quest 업데이트가 실제로 동작하는 영상과 더 많은 사람이 자신만의 창의력으로 만들 수 있도록 돕는 개발 가이드, 그리고 약간의 비하인드 스토리.","k36970242":"새로운 기능","k5d12bd53":"플레이","kbee75ca7":"조작법","kfc338f87":"기능","ka239107e":"버전","k14e8617e":"설치 도움말","kcf04a7f5":"FM-1용 No Man Sky FM","ked4318b7":"M-VAVE FM-1을 위한 무료 펌웨어: 한 손으로는 노브 두 개로 우주 모험을 하고, 다른 손으로는 음악을 만듭니다. 행성 위를 날고, 레이스하고, 채굴하고, 싸우고, 별 사이를 워프하세요.","ka16e30a0":"SLOOP 2.8.4 기반","kcce2664d":"펌웨어 파일 다운로드","kcd5af734":"릴리스 노트","kaeaf06e3":"에디터 열기","kb3782d9b":"v0.9의 새 기능","k30a2439c":"아직 최적화 중입니다.","k2ea97e86":"이번 버전은 한꺼번에 많은 것이 들어와서 3D 비행과 일부 화면에서 프레임이 떨어질 수 있습니다. 다음 버전에서 최적화가 더 이어집니다. 백업을 해 두시고, 느린 부분을 알려 주세요.","kb23035c2":"영상의 모든 음악은 게임을 하면서 FM-1에서 실시간으로 만들었습니다. 이전 버전에서 촬영했습니다.","k9856dddb":"여기서 플레이","k64312600":"브라우저에서 실행되는 진짜 펌웨어입니다. 화면을 클릭해 전원을 켠 뒤 노브, 버튼 또는 컴퓨터 키보드를 사용하세요.","k4e787811":"조작법","ka38197a6":"HOME에서는 FM-1이 곧 게임입니다.","kd1752358":"짧게 누르면 기존 기능 그대로입니다.","k66647c2c":"길게 누르기, 두 번 누르기, 동시에 누르기만 새로운 동작을 합니다. 한 번 누르면 OCT−와 OCT+는 여전히 옥타브를 바꾸고, 다른 모든 버튼은 SLOOP에서와 똑같이 동작합니다.","kca032b58":"하는 일","kd93e1cee":"모든 클립은 실제 화면입니다.","k7d0a579d":"모든 버전","ke2e004bd":"각 버전에 들어간 내용.","ke29b98d8":"설치: 자세히","k77340732":"FM-1을 켤 때 OCT−만 길게 누르면 USB 복구 모드가 됩니다.","k99b506be":"설치 로그","k2f388ccb":"No Man Sky FM은 isod89의 SLOOP 2.8.4를 기반으로 하며, SLOOP은 Leo Kuroshita (Hügelton Instruments)의 Felucca를 기반으로 합니다. GPL-3.0. 테이프, PARTY, 스케일 아르페지오, KEY LED는 winampFM에서 왔고, 샘플 에디터는 ½ sampler를 따랐으며, 게임은 Low Mem Sky (PICO-8)에서 영감을 받았습니다.","k6d21d709":"전체 펌웨어의 소스가 공개되어 있습니다. 기능을 자유롭게 작업에 사용하세요. README나 영상에 No Man Sky FM을 밝혀 주시기만 하면 됩니다.","kba54bb5f":"No Man’s Sky에서 영감을 받은 팬 제작 데메이크입니다. Hello Games 및 M-VAVE와 관련이 없습니다. M-VAVE와 FM-1은 각 소유자의 상표입니다.","k7807532a":"쿠키와 통계 (Google Analytics)","kcd39008a":"이 사이트는 Google Analytics(방문과 클릭 집계)에만 쿠키를 사용합니다. 광고에는 아무것도 사용하지 않습니다.","kbb54db51":"동의","kb59cf9ed":"거부","k273757aa":"No Man Sky FM · M-VAVE FM-1을 위한 우주 모험","kc8675119":"No Man Sky FM: M-VAVE FM-1을 위한 무료 실험적 펌웨어. 3D로 행성 위를 날고, 레이스하고, 착륙하고, 채굴하고, 싸우고, 별 사이를 워프하며 여정의 사운드트랙을 만드세요.","s_title":"시뮬레이터 · 진짜 펌웨어 (WebAssembly)","s_on":"전원 켜기","s_snd":"사운드","s_reset":"메모리 초기화","s_hint":"화면을 클릭해 전원을 켜세요. KNOB 1과 2로 날고, OCT+를 길게 눌러 착륙하고, 키를 연주해 사운드트랙을 만드세요.","s_scr":"픽셀 단위로 똑같은 화면","s_scrn":"모델의 유리 화면과 같은 그림입니다. 펌웨어가 240×240 LCD에 그리는 그대로입니다.","s_how":"플레이 방법","s_k12":"우주선 회전 · 속도 (행성에서: 걷기)","s_a":"부스트 · 행성에서: 달리기 (가만히 있을 때: 우주선 호출)","s_b":"행성 진입 · 착륙 · 레이저 · 우주선 옆에서 이륙","s_map":"워프 지도","s_oct":"평소처럼 옥타브","s_k34":"줌 (클로즈업과 조종석까지) · 트랙의 볼륨","s_home":"레이더 · HOME 길게 누름: 행성에서는 우주선, 우주에서는 메뉴","s_play":"음악","s_keys":"음 연주","s_held":"모델의 버튼을 오른쪽 클릭(또는 Shift+클릭)하면 누른 상태로 유지됩니다.","s_clk":"클릭해서 전원 켜기","s_pow":"전원 켜는 중…","s_ask":"시뮬레이터 메모리를 지우고 다시 시작할까요?","s_noM":"MIDI 장치를 찾을 수 없습니다","s_arw":"화살표 ↑↓ 회전","s_ohd":"OCT− 길게 누름","s_bhd":"OCT+ 길게 누름","s_ock":"OCT 클릭","s_kk":"키"},"ja":{"kb8849040":"惑星を選ぶと、船の後ろから飛んで降りていきます。歩くのと同じ地面の上を飛びます。海、砂、草、木、丘、山が3Dで広がります。","kb09c738b":"旋回","k92b63208":"速度","kdc6a27fe":"OCT− 長押し","kf7d80df0":"ブースト","kc61673a7":"OCT+ 長押し","ka7fc8274":"陸に着陸：船の下の木がピクセルになって弾け、そのまま歩けます。水の上では着陸できません","k986c0f88":"下に回す：宇宙に戻る","kcfb32465":"惑星の上で最高速度のまま少し飛ぶと、4隻の船が横に並びます。6つの光のビームを最初に通り抜けた人がクレジットを獲得します。","k56e3bd35":"このレースでは、陸の上でOCT+を長押しするとほかの船が飛び続ける間、少しだけ着陸できます。もう一度長押しすると飛び立ちます。","kab0d0977":"宇宙では、ときどきチェッカーフラッグの船が現れます。止まっているときや、前方にいます。その船のそばでOCT+を長押しすると道路レースが始まり、終わると宇宙に戻ります。","ked1cc0e2":"Galactic Racerにインスパイアされ、FM-1に収まる範囲に絞りました。惑星のレースフラッグ、ステーションのゲート、ネオンの宇宙レースはなくなり、その分の容量を新機能に使いました。","k02e264ad":"音色を変えるたびに、音色が3DのカルーセルにCDとして並び、それぞれに名前が付きます。新しいCDが転がり込んで回り、画面は元の場所に戻ります。","k0b3564fb":"HOME、PRESETSページ、TRACKS","k9646b430":"PRESETSページ","kfc0aebc8":"ドラムキット","k8a2329ac":"ドラムトラック","k2a8131c7":"winampFMのテープから：同じ42色のカラーセットと、同じアートの作り方を、ディスクで再現しました。","kc7ae3fa6":"SLOOP 2.8.4：MIDIクロックがより安定、全トラックのフィルターにレゾナンス、ドラムにフィルター、よりきれいなフェード、UNISONとPHYSの修正、SAMPLEとGRAINが上の鍵盤に追従、より頑丈な第2コア、より確実なレスキュー。","k121ef6a0":"FX > PARTY（winampFMより）：ステージに立つ人を選びます。ソロ、デュエル、トリオ、全員、リード、そして1、2、4、8小節ごとにステージが自動で切り替わります。","k212569d7":"ARP 2 > ORD SCL（winampFMより）：1つの鍵盤でスケール全体、2つの鍵盤でその間のスケールを演奏します。HOLDがオンのとき、同じ音をもう一度押すと止まります。","k4edd58b9":"EDIT > WAVE、ミニサンプルエディター（½ samplerにならって）：画面全体に波形を表示し、IN、OUT、LOOP、TUNEをノブで操作します。","k7ffaedeb":"メニュー > SEQ：STEP ADVANCE、DRUM PREVIEW、FILTER RESO。","k9f2541ea":"容量を確保するため、BASS、ハイハット、シンバルを22kHzから16kHzに、SCRATCHを11kHzに下げました。削除した音はありません。","k09955c94":"No Man Sky FMエディター：isod89さんのSLOOPエディターに、私たちの名前と色を付けたものです。曲、音色、ピアノロール、MIDI、バックアップをパソコンから扱えます。","k9cb995c1":"このページにシミュレーター一式があります。3Dモデル、ピクセル単位で同じ画面、コントロールを並べて表示します。","k2510c70d":"6言語：英語、ポルトガル語、韓国語、日本語、ドイツ語、フランス語。","k06ace978":"3Dの惑星","k9af3f864":"レース","k82510ca3":"CD","kb4e3efeb":"サウンド","k9629fc86":"エディターとサイト","k62cf05b6":"船を旋回","kf5e2b043":"ズーム：ワイド、近く、クローズアップ、キャビン","k3a96d969":"選択中のトラックの音量","k4d8edb7c":"テンポ","k0bd7625b":"ブースト（1.2秒：パルスジャンプ）","kb716a492":"オートブースト（もう一度クリックでオフ）","kad5ceaf9":"惑星に入る・ドッキング・旗の船とレース","k33b2ad58":"ワープマップ","k87c70a0b":"レーダー","k4823aacf":"HOME 長押し","k1dff73ec":"メニュー","k73dad583":"速度（最高速度で少し飛ぶとレース）","k5a64c49b":"着陸（レース中にもう一度で飛行）","kdf06b147":"歩く","kea567fff":"走る・止まっているとき：船を呼ぶ","k8e7ca96b":"レーザー（離すと回収）・船のそばで離陸","k85eaed4f":"船を呼ぶ","ka9ccbb94":"ステージに立つ人","kfdb309c6":"ミニサンプルエディター","k88dd24ae":"SCL：1つか2つの鍵盤でスケールを演奏","k7dd888f2":"STEP ADVANCE、DRUM PREVIEW、FILTER RESO","kcd92dc96":"鍵盤が生む光：波、雨、彗星、花火","k8de073a2":"ドラムのTUNEとDECAY","k66adecc9":"QUANT ON / OFF：グリッドに合わせず録音","k59d4f603":"宇宙で","k3ed10c21":"惑星の上で","k39c7937a":"徒歩で","k97f44890":"新しい画面","ke27f466b":"宇宙の冒険","k4576054d":"FM-1の電源を入れると、あなたの船が星々の中へ飛んできます。専用のシンセウェーブのテーマ曲つきです。どのボタンでもスキップできます。","k975b6b23":"電源オン","k2b8e1848":"オープニング、そしてゲーム","kb093ecac":"惑星の間を飛ぶ","k77256c5f":"近くの惑星が画面の端で待っていて、光年単位の距離が表示されます。どれも違います。色、海、丘、リングなど。","kecee81ec":"旋回、速度","k5954d15d":"ブースト、そしてパルスジャンプ","k2803a730":"ズームして、中に入る","k43306160":"光の長い軌跡の中にいる船にズームし、もう一度ズームするとキャビンの中に座れます。","k4430b15c":"ワイド・近く・クローズアップ・キャビン","kc2f4739c":"ほかの星へワープ","k07fcf2e1":"銀河マップを開き、星系を選んでジャンプ：光のトンネルを抜けると新しい惑星に着きます。","kc0fa4797":"マップ","k271e9a56":"ジャンプ","k60c56c36":"おだやかな飛行","k8a247bf7":"オートブーストを設定し、やわらかいループを始めて、ただ飛びましょう。","k9aa61141":"オートブースト オン / オフ","k5e0b5619":"惑星の中へ","kb31ea7af":"点線のリングが点滅するまで近づいてOCT+を長押しすると、惑星の地面の上を3Dで飛びながら降りていきます。","k7906058d":"入る、そして着陸","k7bf66fa8":"ロボット、レーザー、戦利品","ka5eed2eb":"歩いて、レーザーで採掘し、センチネルと戦います。3回当てると爆発します。敵対的な惑星では撃ち返してきます。","k71f8a623":"レーザー（離すと回収）","k8cb31094":"船を呼んで離陸","kd5011982":"船があなたのそばに降りてきます。そばでOCT+を長押しすると、ピクセルアートのムービーが雲を抜けて宇宙へ連れ戻してくれます。","k7c0ed89a":"離陸","kc42a2f1c":"追ってくる","k8ea7fd1b":"戦ったロボットが赤い船になって宇宙まで追いかけてきます。思いきりブーストすると振り切れます。","k9bdf185f":"ブーストで逃げる","kbe41101b":"惑星の上でレース","k5d8a5c15":"最高速度で飛ぶと4隻の船が加わります。6つの光のビームを通り、順位に応じてクレジットがもらえます。","k3333c386":"最高速度まで","k56b2d3e1":"旗をつけた船","ke208b11a":"ときどき宇宙でレーサーが待っています。そばでOCT+を長押しすると道路レースが始まり、終わると元の場所に戻ります。","kde4bedce":"レース","ke1df3f25":"サウンドトラックを作る","kda37506e":"SLOOPの機能がすべて使えます。ループ、ステップ、ドラム、エフェクト。旅を続けながら、すべて操作できます。","kc13440a0":"ループを録音","ka9e6fa99":"SEQ 長押し + 鍵盤","k6578912e":"ステップ","k5b1626c3":"FX 長押し + 鍵盤","k55ab2cbb":"パフォーマンスエフェクト","k1923752a":"音色がCDに","k687533d1":"音色を変えると、その名前がついたCDが転がり込んできます。","kfb866fad":"音色を変える","k1b7d7165":"すべての画面がゲームの上に","kd114ea44":"ページ、レイヤー、REC、メニュー：ゲームは暗いピクセルのメッシュ越しに、後ろで動き続けます。","k98e91f6d":"どのページでも","k7cbe8abe":"後ろのゲーム","kf6d700f5":"飛行","kef23509a":"惑星","k60384fa6":"戦いとレース","k131260cb":"音楽","kcbc8b5aa":"3Dの惑星、新しいレース、CD、SLOOP 2.8.4。リリース済み。","kb346d4c1":"歩く地面の上を、それぞれの惑星で3D飛行。陸への着陸、ピクセルになって弾ける木","kd883b9b4":"4人のライバルと6つのビームで惑星の上をレース。旗の船が宇宙の道路レースを始めます","k9c33822b":"音色を変えるたびにCD（winampFMのテープにならって）","k69e0b472":"isod89さんのSLOOP 2.8.4を統合","kaa246f80":"PARTYとスケールアルペジオ（winampFMより）","k1d9920a3":"ゲーム上の画面がずっと軽くなりました：変わった部分だけをLCDに送ります","k66857ce2":"サイト上のエディター、シミュレーター一式、6言語","k0fc1909a":"容量確保のため削除：惑星のレースフラッグ、ステーションのゲート、ネオンの宇宙レース。BASS、ハイハット、シンバル、SCRATCHのサンプルレートを低下","kbc6101e6":"テストビルドで、リリースはされていません。","k8cc090e9":"EDIT > WAVE、ミニサンプルエディター（½ samplerにならって）","k2303fd3b":"ノブを回したあと2秒間、4つのノブの役割を示すバー","k7cbfd71f":"今いるページを示すドット","kcfd9dc35":"ビジュアルに各トラックの色を反映","ka9feadb0":"銀河がにぎやかになりました。","kcfa1d2fa":"宇宙での戦い：連射してくるボスは30秒で倒れ、小さな船が次々と現れます","kba483788":"ときどき海賊が星系を襲います：2〜6隻","k0534a559":"鍵盤を押し続けて護衛を呼びます：長い軌跡をひく小さな白い船","ka64eda06":"惑星と宇宙のネオンの道路でレース。ギアとピクセルのダッシュボードつき","kb602be8b":"すべてのステーションにハンガー：5隻の船、エンジンと武器のアップグレード","k7ddb9617":"一部の惑星にはクエストをくれる人々がいて、通りがかりの船が話しかけてきます","k9b6081cd":"RECがアルペジオとパンチインFXを保持し、プロジェクトと一緒に保存","kf79e460b":"船の3Dモデルから描き起こした新しい離陸とクローズアップ","k7bf542e0":"最初の公開バージョン：サイト、インストーラー、シミュレーター。","kc3db383f":"SLOOP 2.7.1を統合：両コアでのサウンド、15種類のARPモード、KBD HOLD、MIDI 3、SAVE SECTION A–D、お気に入りの音色、REC QUANTオフ、ユーザーサンプルのループ、ノブの加速、USBオーディオレート","kd402a7c9":"KEY LED：鍵盤が生む光（winampFMより）","k912e556d":"GLO > DRUM SOUND：ドラムのTUNEとDECAY","ke89ae343":"専用の音楽つきオープニング、星々の後ろの星雲、惑星のリング","kd95bd2f5":"旅する銀河。","k96aba26f":"銀河マップ、ワープ、ステーション、取引、燃料、セーブデータ","kd712bf1a":"惑星のセンチネル、レーザー戦、敵対的な惑星、宇宙までの追跡","k4f34c665":"ブースト、パルスジャンプ、オートブースト、レーダー、クローズアップ、キャビン","k897fc7a2":"回したノブに合わせたビジュアル、離陸とワープのムービー","k147e5d86":"HOMEのゲーム。","k8adacd22":"HOMEで遊べる宇宙ゲーム。Low Mem Sky（PICO-8）とNo Man's Skyにインスパイアされています：星、球体の惑星、着陸、歩行、資源、生き物、スキャナー","k1b0aa9c3":"白黒の上に4色。反転した文字ではなくピクセルのテクスチャ","kc767dde1":"ベース。","k8064f8c8":"isod89さんのSLOOP 2.6（Leo KuroshitaさんのFelucca がベース）をもとにしています：同じサウンドと同じボタン","k08d8c5e5":"新しい画面：白黒、数字とバーだけ","kc7e9fb2e":"エディター","k77e39fce":"<b>リアルな寄り道</b><br>テクノロジーの勉強の進み具合を共有する、私の個人的な場所です。シンセの勉強、No Man Sky FM、winampFM、FM1 Questの改良とテスト、ESP32を使ったロボットのプロトタイプなど。","k31168e75":"<b>デモとアップデート</b><br>No Man Sky FM、winampFM、FM1 Questのアップデートが動く様子の動画、より多くの人が自分らしく作れるようにする開発ガイド、そして舞台裏も少し。","k36970242":"新着情報","k5d12bd53":"遊ぶ","kbee75ca7":"操作","kfc338f87":"機能","ka239107e":"バージョン","k14e8617e":"インストールのヘルプ","kcf04a7f5":"FM-1のためのNo Man Sky FM","ked4318b7":"M-VAVE FM-1用の無料ファームウェア。片手で2つのノブを回して遊ぶ宇宙の冒険を、もう片手で音楽を作りながら楽しめます。惑星を飛び、レースをして、採掘し、戦い、星々の間をワープします。","ka16e30a0":"SLOOP 2.8.4がベース","kcce2664d":"ファームウェアファイルをダウンロード","kcd5af734":"リリースノート","kaeaf06e3":"エディターを開く","kb3782d9b":"v0.9の新機能","k30a2439c":"最適化の途中です。","k2ea97e86":"このバージョンは一度に多くの内容を追加したため、3D飛行や一部の画面でコマ落ちすることがあります。今後のバージョンでさらに最適化します。バックアップを取って、重いと感じたところを教えてください。","kb23035c2":"動画の音楽はすべて、ゲームを遊びながらFM-1でライブ演奏したものです。以前のバージョンで撮影しています。","k9856dddb":"ここで遊ぶ","k64312600":"ブラウザ上で本物のファームウェアが動きます。画面をクリックして電源を入れ、ノブ、ボタン、またはパソコンのキーボードで操作してください。","k4e787811":"操作方法","ka38197a6":"HOMEでは、FM-1がゲームになります。","kd1752358":"短く押すと、いつもの機能のままです。","k66647c2c":"長押し、ダブルタップ、同時押しだけが新しい動作になります。1回押すだけなら、OCT−とOCT+はこれまでどおりオクターブを変え、ほかのボタンもSLOOPのときと同じ動作です。","kca032b58":"できること","kd93e1cee":"どのクリップも実際の画面です。","k7d0a579d":"すべてのバージョン","ke2e004bd":"各バージョンの内容です。","ke29b98d8":"インストールの詳細","k77340732":"USBレスキューを使うには、FM-1の電源を入れるときにOCT−だけを押し続けます。","k99b506be":"インストールログ","k2f388ccb":"No Man Sky FMは、isod89さんのSLOOP 2.8.4をもとにしており、これはLeo Kuroshitaさん（Hügelton Instruments）のFelucca をもとにしています。GPL-3.0。テープ、PARTY、スケールアルペジオ、KEY LEDはwinampFMから、サンプルエディターは½ samplerにならい、ゲームはLow Mem Sky（PICO-8）にインスパイアされています。","k6d21d709":"ファームウェア全体のソースコードは公開されています。自由にご自身の制作に使えますが、READMEや動画にNo Man Sky FMのクレジットを入れてください。","kba54bb5f":"No Man's Skyにインスパイアされたファンメイドのデメイクです。Hello GamesおよびM-VAVEとは関係ありません。M-VAVEとFM-1は、それぞれの所有者の商標です。","k7807532a":"Cookieと統計（Google Analytics）","kcd39008a":"このサイトでは、Google Analytics（訪問数とクリック数の集計）のためだけにCookieを使います。広告には一切使いません。","kbb54db51":"同意する","kb59cf9ed":"拒否する","k273757aa":"No Man Sky FM · M-VAVE FM-1のための宇宙の冒険","kc8675119":"No Man Sky FM：M-VAVE FM-1用の無料の実験的ファームウェア。惑星を3Dで飛び、レースをして、着陸し、採掘し、戦い、星々の間をワープしながら、旅のサウンドトラックを作れます。","s_title":"シミュレーター · 本物のファームウェア（WebAssembly）","s_on":"電源オン","s_snd":"サウンド","s_reset":"メモリをリセット","s_hint":"画面をクリックして電源を入れます。KNOB 1と2で飛び、OCT+を長押しで着陸、鍵盤を弾いてサウンドトラックを作りましょう。","s_scr":"画面（ピクセル単位）","s_scrn":"モデルのガラスに映るのと同じ映像です。ファームウェアが240×240のLCDに描いているものです。","s_how":"遊び方","s_k12":"船を旋回・速度（惑星の上では歩く）","s_a":"ブースト・惑星の上では走る（止まっているとき：船を呼ぶ）","s_b":"惑星に入る・着陸・レーザー・船のそばで離陸","s_map":"ワープマップ","s_oct":"いつもどおりのオクターブ","s_k34":"ズーム（クローズアップとキャビンへ）・トラックの音量","s_home":"レーダー・HOME 長押し：惑星では船、宇宙ではメニュー","s_play":"音楽","s_keys":"音を弾く","s_held":"モデルのボタンを右クリック（またはShift+クリック）すると、押したままになります。","s_clk":"クリックして電源オン","s_pow":"電源を入れています…","s_ask":"シミュレーターのメモリを消去して再起動しますか？","s_noM":"MIDIデバイスが見つかりません","s_arw":"矢印 ↑↓ で旋回","s_ohd":"OCT− 長押し","s_bhd":"OCT+ 長押し","s_ock":"OCTクリック","s_kk":"鍵盤"},"de":{"kb8849040":"Wähle einen Planeten und du fliegst hinunter, hinter dem Schiff, über demselben Boden, auf dem du läufst: Meere, Sand, Gras, Bäume, Hügel und Gipfel in 3D.","kb09c738b":"drehen","k92b63208":"Tempo","kdc6a27fe":"OCT− gehalten","kf7d80df0":"Boost","kc61673a7":"OCT+ gehalten","ka7fc8274":"an Land landen: Ein Baum unter dem Schiff zerfällt zu Pixeln, dann gehst du zu Fuß. Über Wasser geht es nicht","k986c0f88":"nach unten gedreht: zurück in den Weltraum","kcfb32465":"Über einem Planeten: Flieg kurz mit Höchstgeschwindigkeit, und vier Schiffe tauchen neben dir auf. Wer zuerst durch die sechs Lichtstrahlen kommt, gewinnt Credits.","k56e3bd35":"Halte in diesem Rennen OCT+ über Land, um kurz zu landen, während die anderen weiterfliegen. Halte es noch einmal, um zu fliegen.","kab0d0977":"Im Weltraum: Ab und zu taucht ein Schiff mit Zielflagge auf, wenn du stillstehst oder vor dir. Halte OCT+ daneben für das Straßenrennen, danach bist du wieder im Weltraum.","ked1cc0e2":"Inspiriert von Galactic Racer, reduziert auf das, was auf den FM-1 passt. Die Rennflaggen auf Planeten, die Tore an den Stationen und das Neon-Weltraumrennen sind weg: Der Platz ging an die neuen.","k02e264ad":"Bei jedem Soundwechsel erscheinen die Sounds als CDs in einem 3D-Karussell, jeweils mit ihrem Namen darauf: Die neue rollt herein, dreht sich und wirbelt, und der Bildschirm kehrt dorthin zurück, wo du warst.","k0b3564fb":"auf HOME, auf der PRESETS-Seite, in TRACKS","k9646b430":"auf der PRESETS-Seite","kfc0aebc8":"Drumkit","k8a2329ac":"auf der Drum-Spur","k2a8131c7":"Von den Tapes von winampFM: dieselben 42 Farbsets und dieselbe Art, die Bilder zu machen, auf Discs.","kc7ae3fa6":"SLOOP 2.8.4: stabilerer MIDI-Clock, Resonanz auf jedem Spurfilter, ein Filter auf den Drums, sauberere Fades, UNISON- und PHYS-Fixes, SAMPLE und GRAIN folgen den oberen Tasten, ein robusterer zweiter Kern, zuverlässigere Rettung.","k121ef6a0":"FX > PARTY (aus winampFM): wer auf der Bühne steht. Solo, Duell, Trio oder alle, ein Lead, und die Bühne kann sich alle 1, 2, 4 oder 8 Takte von selbst drehen.","k212569d7":"ARP 2 > ORD SCL (aus winampFM): Eine Taste spielt die ganze Tonleiter, zwei Tasten die Tonleiter dazwischen. Bei aktivem HOLD stoppt dieselbe Note noch einmal.","k4edd58b9":"EDIT > WAVE, ein Mini-Sample-Editor (nach dem ½ sampler): die Wellenform auf dem ganzen Bildschirm, mit IN, OUT, LOOP und TUNE auf den Reglern.","k7ffaedeb":"Menü > SEQ: STEP ADVANCE, DRUM PREVIEW und FILTER RESO.","k9f2541ea":"Um Platz zu schaffen, gingen BASS, Hi-Hats und Becken von 22 auf 16 kHz und SCRATCH auf 11 kHz. Es wurde kein Sound entfernt.","k09955c94":"Der No Man Sky FM Editor: der SLOOP-Editor von isod89 mit unserem Namen und unseren Farben. Songs, Sounds, Piano Roll, MIDI und Backups vom Computer aus.","k9cb995c1":"Der ganze Simulator auf dieser Seite: das 3D-Modell, der Bildschirm Pixel für Pixel und die Bedienelemente nebeneinander.","k2510c70d":"Sechs Sprachen: Englisch, Portugiesisch, Koreanisch, Japanisch, Deutsch und Französisch.","k06ace978":"Der Planet in 3D","k9af3f864":"Rennen","k82510ca3":"CDs","kb4e3efeb":"Sound","k9629fc86":"Editor und Website","k62cf05b6":"das Schiff drehen","kf5e2b043":"Zoom: weit, nah, Nahaufnahme, Kabine","k3a96d969":"die Lautstärke der gewählten Spur","k4d8edb7c":"das Tempo","k0bd7625b":"Boost (1,2 s: Pulssprung)","kb716a492":"automatischer Boost (noch ein Klick: aus)","kad5ceaf9":"einen Planeten betreten · andocken · das Flaggenschiff herausfordern","k33b2ad58":"die Warp-Karte","k87c70a0b":"Radar","k4823aacf":"HOME gehalten","k1dff73ec":"das Menü","k73dad583":"Tempo (kurz ganz oben: ein Rennen)","k5a64c49b":"landen (im Rennen noch einmal: fliegen)","kdf06b147":"gehen","kea567fff":"rennen · im Stand: das Schiff rufen","k8e7ca96b":"Laser (loslassen: einsammeln) · am Schiff abheben","k85eaed4f":"das Schiff rufen","ka9ccbb94":"wer auf der Bühne steht","kfdb309c6":"der Mini-Sample-Editor","k88dd24ae":"SCL: die Tonleiter aus ein oder zwei Tasten","k7dd888f2":"STEP ADVANCE, DRUM PREVIEW, FILTER RESO","kcd92dc96":"das Licht einer Taste: Wellen, Regen, Komet, Feuerwerk","k8de073a2":"TUNE und DECAY eines Drums","k66adecc9":"QUANT ON / OFF: neben dem Raster aufnehmen","k59d4f603":"Im Weltraum","k3ed10c21":"Über einem Planeten","k39c7937a":"Zu Fuß","k97f44890":"Neue Bildschirme","ke27f466b":"Ein Weltraumabenteuer","k4576054d":"Schalte den FM-1 ein: Dein Schiff fliegt über die Sterne herein, mit eigenem Synthwave-Thema. Jede Taste überspringt es.","k975b6b23":"einschalten","k2b8e1848":"der Vorspann, dann das Spiel","kb093ecac":"Zwischen Planeten fliegen","k77256c5f":"Die nächsten Planeten warten am Bildschirmrand, mit ihrer Entfernung in Lichtjahren. Jeder ist anders: Farben, Meere, Hügel, Ringe.","kecee81ec":"drehen, Tempo","k5954d15d":"Boost, dann der Pulssprung","k2803a730":"Heranzoomen, dann hineintreten","k43306160":"Zoome auf dein Schiff zwischen langen Lichtspuren und noch einmal, um in seiner Kabine zu sitzen.","k4430b15c":"weit · nah · Nahaufnahme · Kabine","kc2f4739c":"Zu anderen Sternen warpen","k07fcf2e1":"Öffne die Galaxiekarte, wähle ein System und spring: ein Lichttunnel, dann neue Planeten.","kc0fa4797":"die Karte","k271e9a56":"springen","k60c56c36":"Ruhiger Flug","k8a247bf7":"Stell den automatischen Boost ein, starte einen sanften Loop und flieg einfach.","k9aa61141":"automatischer Boost an / aus","k5e0b5619":"In den Planeten","kb31ea7af":"Flieg nah heran, bis der gepunktete Ring blinkt, und halte OCT+: Du fliegst über seinen Boden hinunter, in 3D.","k7906058d":"betreten, dann landen","k7bf66fa8":"Roboter, Laser, Beute","ka5eed2eb":"Lauf, baue mit dem Laser ab und kämpfe gegen die Wächter: Nach drei Treffern explodieren sie. Manche Planeten sind feindlich und schießen zurück.","k71f8a623":"der Laser (loslassen: einsammeln)","k8cb31094":"Das Schiff rufen, abheben","kd5011982":"Das Schiff landet neben dir. Halte dort OCT+: Ein Pixel-Art-Film trägt dich durch die Wolken zurück in den Weltraum.","k7c0ed89a":"abheben","kc42a2f1c":"Sie folgen dir","k8ea7fd1b":"Die Roboter, gegen die du gekämpft hast, folgen dir als rote Schiffe in den Weltraum. Boost stark genug, und du schüttelst sie ab.","k9bdf185f":"davonboosten","kbe41101b":"Rennen über dem Planeten","k5d8a5c15":"Bei Höchstgeschwindigkeit stoßen vier Schiffe zu dir: sechs Lichtstrahlen, Credits für den Platz, auf dem du ins Ziel kommst.","k3333c386":"ganz nach oben","k56b2d3e1":"Das Schiff mit der Flagge","ke208b11a":"Ab und zu wartet ein Rennfahrer im Weltraum. Halte OCT+ daneben für das Straßenrennen, danach bist du wieder dort, wo du warst.","kde4bedce":"Rennen","ke1df3f25":"Den Soundtrack machen","kda37506e":"Alles von SLOOP ist dabei: Loops, Steps, Drums, Effekte. Und das alles, während die Reise weitergeht.","kc13440a0":"einen Loop aufnehmen","ka9e6fa99":"SEQ gehalten + Tasten","k6578912e":"Steps","k5b1626c3":"FX gehalten + Taste","k55ab2cbb":"ein Live-Effekt","k1923752a":"Sounds als CDs","k687533d1":"Wechsle einen Sound, und seine CD rollt mit seinem Namen darauf herein.","kfb866fad":"den Sound wechseln","k1b7d7165":"Jeder Bildschirm über dem Spiel","kd114ea44":"Seiten, Layer, REC, das Menü: Das Spiel bleibt dahinter, durch ein dunkles Pixelgitter.","k98e91f6d":"jede Seite","k7cbe8abe":"das Spiel dahinter","kf6d700f5":"Flug","kef23509a":"Planeten","k60384fa6":"Kämpfe und Rennen","k131260cb":"Musik","kcbc8b5aa":"Der Planet in 3D, neue Rennen, CDs, SLOOP 2.8.4. Veröffentlicht.","kb346d4c1":"Flug über jedem Planeten in 3D, über dem Boden, auf dem du läufst; Landen an Land, Bäume, die zu Pixeln zerfallen","kd883b9b4":"Rennen über dem Planeten mit vier Rivalen und sechs Strahlen; ein Schiff mit Flagge startet das Straßenrennen im Weltraum","k9c33822b":"CDs bei jedem Soundwechsel (nach den Tapes von winampFM)","k69e0b472":"SLOOP 2.8.4 von isod89 eingebunden","kaa246f80":"PARTY und der Tonleiter-Arpeggio (aus winampFM)","k1d9920a3":"Bildschirme über dem Spiel viel leichter: Nur was sich ändert, geht an das LCD","k66857ce2":"Der Editor auf der Website, der ganze Simulator, sechs Sprachen","k0fc1909a":"Zugunsten von Platz entfernt: Rennflaggen auf Planeten, Stationstore, das Neon-Weltraumrennen. Niedrigere Sample-Raten bei BASS, Hi-Hats, Becken und SCRATCH","kbc6101e6":"Test-Builds, nie veröffentlicht.","k8cc090e9":"EDIT > WAVE, der Mini-Sample-Editor (nach dem ½ sampler)","k2303fd3b":"Ein Streifen, der zwei Sekunden nach dem Drehen sagt, was die vier Regler tun","k7cbfd71f":"Punkte, die die aktuelle Seite zeigen","kcfd9dc35":"Farben jeder Spur in den Visuals","ka9feadb0":"Die Galaxie wurde belebter.","kcfa1d2fa":"Schlachten im Weltraum: ein Boss, der Salven feuert und in 30 s untergeht, kleine Schiffe, die immer wieder kommen","kba483788":"Piraten überfallen ab und zu das System: 2 bis 6 Schiffe","k0534a559":"Halte Tasten, um Begleiter zu rufen: kleine weiße Schiffe mit langen Spuren","ka64eda06":"Rennen auf Planeten und auf einer Neonstraße im Weltraum, mit Gängen und einem Pixel-Armaturenbrett","kb602be8b":"Ein Hangar in jeder Station: fünf Schiffe, Upgrades für Triebwerk und Waffen","k7ddb9617":"Menschen auf manchen Planeten mit Quests, vorbeifliegende Schiffe, die dich ansprechen","k9b6081cd":"REC behält den Arp und die Punch-in-FX, mit dem Projekt gespeichert","kf79e460b":"Ein neuer Abflug und eine Nahaufnahme, gezeichnet nach einem 3D-Modell des Schiffs","k7bf542e0":"Erste öffentliche Version: Website, Installer, Simulator.","kc3db383f":"SLOOP 2.7.1 eingebunden: der Sound auf beiden Kernen, 15 Arp-Modi, KBD HOLD, MIDI 3, SAVE SECTION A–D, Lieblingssounds, REC QUANT aus, geloopte User-Samples, Reglerbeschleunigung, USB-Audiorate","kd402a7c9":"KEY LED: das Licht einer Taste (aus winampFM)","k912e556d":"GLO > DRUM SOUND: TUNE und DECAY eines Drums","ke89ae343":"Der Vorspann mit eigener Musik; ein Nebel hinter den Sternen; Ringe um Planeten","kd95bd2f5":"Eine Galaxie zum Bereisen.","k96aba26f":"Galaxiekarte, Warp, Stationen, Handel, Treibstoff und Spielstände","kd712bf1a":"Wächter auf Planeten, Laserkämpfe, feindliche Planeten, Verfolgung in den Weltraum","k4f34c665":"Boost, Pulssprung, automatischer Boost, Radar, Nahaufnahme, Kabine","k897fc7a2":"Visuals hinter den Reglern, die du drehst; Abflug- und Warp-Filme","k147e5d86":"Das Spiel auf HOME.","k8adacd22":"Ein Weltraumspiel auf HOME, inspiriert von Low Mem Sky (PICO-8) und No Man’s Sky: Sterne, kugelförmige Planeten, Landen, Gehen, Ressourcen, Kreaturen, Scanner","k1b0aa9c3":"Vier Farben über Schwarz und Weiß; Pixeltexturen statt invertierter Schrift","kc767dde1":"Die Basis.","k8064f8c8":"Gebaut auf SLOOP 2.6 von isod89 (basierend auf Felucca von Leo Kuroshita): derselbe Sound und dieselben Tasten","k08d8c5e5":"Neue Bildschirme: Schwarz-Weiß, nur Zahlen und Balken","kc7e9fb2e":"Editor","k77e39fce":"<b>Side Quests aus dem echten Leben</b><br>Mein persönlicher Raum, um den Fortschritt meiner Technikstudien zu teilen: Synths lernen, Verbesserungen und Tests mit No Man Sky FM, winampFM und FM1 Quest sowie Robotik-Prototypen mit ESP32.","k31168e75":"<b>Demos und Updates</b><br>Videos von No Man Sky FM-, winampFM- und FM1-Quest-Updates in Aktion, Entwicklungsanleitungen, damit mehr Menschen mit ihrer eigenen Kreativität etwas bauen können, und ein paar Blicke hinter die Kulissen.","k36970242":"Was ist neu","k5d12bd53":"Spielen","kbee75ca7":"Steuerung","kfc338f87":"Funktionen","ka239107e":"Versionen","k14e8617e":"Installationshilfe","kcf04a7f5":"No Man Sky FM für deinen FM-1","ked4318b7":"Eine kostenlose Firmware für den M-VAVE FM-1: ein Weltraumabenteuer, das du mit zwei Reglern spielst, während die andere Hand die Musik macht. Flieg über Planeten, fahre Rennen, baue ab, kämpfe, warpe zwischen Sternen.","ka16e30a0":"basiert auf SLOOP 2.8.4","kcce2664d":"Firmware-Datei herunterladen","kcd5af734":"Versionshinweise","kaeaf06e3":"Editor öffnen","kb3782d9b":"Neu in v0.9","k30a2439c":"Wird noch optimiert.","k2ea97e86":"Diese Version bringt auf einmal viel mit, deshalb kann der 3D-Flug und manche Bildschirme noch Frames verlieren, und in den nächsten Versionen kommt mehr Optimierung. Mach ein Backup und sag uns, was sich langsam anfühlt.","kb23035c2":"Die ganze Musik im Video wurde live auf dem FM-1 gemacht, während das Spiel lief. Gefilmt mit einer früheren Version.","k9856dddb":"Hier spielen","k64312600":"Die echte Firmware in deinem Browser. Klick auf den Bildschirm, um sie einzuschalten, und nutze dann die Regler, die Tasten oder deine Computertastatur.","k4e787811":"Die Steuerung","ka38197a6":"Auf HOME ist der FM-1 das Spiel.","kd1752358":"Ein kurzer Druck behält die gewohnte Funktion.","k66647c2c":"Nur Halten, Doppeltippen oder gleichzeitiges Drücken bewirkt etwas Neues: Einmal getippt ändern OCT− und OCT+ weiterhin die Oktave, und jede andere Taste tut, was sie bei SLOOP immer getan hat.","kca032b58":"Was es kann","kd93e1cee":"Jeder Clip ist der echte Bildschirm.","k7d0a579d":"Alle Versionen","ke2e004bd":"Was in jeder dazukam.","ke29b98d8":"Installation: Details","k77340732":"Halte OCT− allein gedrückt, während du den FM-1 einschaltest, für die USB-Rettung.","k99b506be":"Installationsprotokoll","k2f388ccb":"No Man Sky FM basiert auf SLOOP 2.8.4 von isod89, das auf Felucca von Leo Kuroshita (Hügelton Instruments) basiert. GPL-3.0. Tapes, PARTY, der Tonleiter-Arpeggio und KEY LED stammen aus winampFM; der Sample-Editor folgt dem ½ sampler; das Spiel ist von Low Mem Sky (PICO-8) inspiriert.","k6d21d709":"Der Quellcode der gesamten Firmware ist offen: Nutze die Funktionen in deiner eigenen Arbeit, nenne nur No Man Sky FM in deiner README oder deinem Video.","kba54bb5f":"Ein Fan-Demake, inspiriert von No Man’s Sky. Nicht verbunden mit Hello Games oder M-VAVE. M-VAVE und FM-1 sind Marken ihrer jeweiligen Inhaber.","k7807532a":"Cookies und Statistiken (Google Analytics)","kcd39008a":"Diese Website verwendet Cookies nur für Google Analytics (Besuche und Klicks zählen). Nichts davon dient Werbung.","kbb54db51":"Akzeptieren","kb59cf9ed":"Ablehnen","k273757aa":"No Man Sky FM · ein Weltraumabenteuer für den M-VAVE FM-1","kc8675119":"No Man Sky FM: eine kostenlose, experimentelle Firmware für den M-VAVE FM-1. Flieg in 3D über Planeten, fahre Rennen, lande, baue ab, kämpfe, warpe zwischen Sternen und mach den Soundtrack deiner Reise.","s_title":"Simulator · die echte Firmware (WebAssembly)","s_on":"einschalten","s_snd":"Ton","s_reset":"Speicher zurücksetzen","s_hint":"Klick auf den Bildschirm zum Einschalten. Flieg mit KNOB 1 und 2, halte OCT+ zum Landen, spiel die Tasten, um den Soundtrack zu machen.","s_scr":"Der Bildschirm, Pixel für Pixel","s_scrn":"Dasselbe Bild wie auf dem Glas des Modells: was die Firmware auf das 240×240-LCD zeichnet.","s_how":"So spielst du","s_k12":"das Schiff drehen · Tempo (auf einem Planeten: gehen)","s_a":"Boost · auf einem Planeten: rennen (im Stand: das Schiff rufen)","s_b":"einen Planeten betreten · landen · Laser · am Schiff abheben","s_map":"die Warp-Karte","s_oct":"die Oktave, wie immer","s_k34":"Zoom (zur Nahaufnahme und zur Kabine) · die Lautstärke der Spur","s_home":"Radar · HOME gehalten: auf einem Planeten das Schiff, im Weltraum das Menü","s_play":"die Musik","s_keys":"Noten spielen","s_held":"Rechtsklick (oder Shift+Klick) auf eine Taste des Modells, um sie gehalten zu lassen.","s_clk":"ZUM EINSCHALTEN KLICKEN","s_pow":"WIRD EINGESCHALTET…","s_ask":"Simulatorspeicher löschen und neu starten?","s_noM":"kein MIDI-Gerät gefunden","s_arw":"Pfeile ↑↓ drehen","s_ohd":"OCT− gehalten","s_bhd":"OCT+ gehalten","s_ock":"OCT-Klick","s_kk":"Tasten"},"fr":{"kb8849040":"Choisissez une planète et vous y descendez en volant, derrière le vaisseau, au-dessus du même sol que vous foulez : mers, sable, herbe, arbres, collines et sommets en 3D.","kb09c738b":"tourner","k92b63208":"vitesse","kdc6a27fe":"OCT− maintenu","kf7d80df0":"boost","kc61673a7":"OCT+ maintenu","ka7fc8274":"atterrir sur terre : un arbre sous le vaisseau explose en pixels, puis vous marchez. Au-dessus de l’eau, c’est refusé","k986c0f88":"refusé : retour dans l’espace","kcfb32465":"Au-dessus d’une planète : volez à pleine vitesse un instant et quatre vaisseaux arrivent à vos côtés. Le premier à franchir les six faisceaux de lumière gagne des crédits.","k56e3bd35":"Dans cette course, maintenez OCT+ au-dessus de la terre pour vous poser un instant pendant que les autres volent. Maintenez-le encore pour repartir.","kab0d0977":"Dans l’espace : un vaisseau à damier apparaît de temps en temps, quand vous restez immobile ou devant vous. Maintenez OCT+ près de lui pour la course sur route, puis vous revenez dans l’espace.","ked1cc0e2":"Inspiré de Galactic Racer, réduit à ce qui tient dans le FM-1. Les drapeaux de course sur les planètes, les portes aux stations et la course néon dans l’espace ont disparu : la place est allée aux nouveautés.","k02e264ad":"À chaque changement de son, les sons s’affichent comme des CD dans un carrousel 3D, avec le nom de chacun : le nouveau arrive en roulant, tourne sur lui-même, et l’écran revient où vous étiez.","k0b3564fb":"sur HOME, sur la page PRESETS, dans TRACKS","k9646b430":"sur la page PRESETS","kfc0aebc8":"kit de batterie","k8a2329ac":"sur la piste de batterie","k2a8131c7":"Issu des cassettes de winampFM : les mêmes 42 jeux de couleurs et la même façon de faire l’image, sur des disques.","kc7ae3fa6":"SLOOP 2.8.4 : horloge MIDI plus stable, résonance sur le filtre de chaque piste, un filtre sur la batterie, fondus plus propres, correctifs UNISON et PHYS, SAMPLE et GRAIN suivent les touches du haut, un second cœur plus robuste, secours plus fiable.","k121ef6a0":"FX > PARTY (depuis winampFM) : qui est sur scène. Solo, duel, trio ou tous, un lead, et la scène peut changer seule toutes les 1, 2, 4 ou 8 mesures.","k212569d7":"ARP 2 > ORD SCL (depuis winampFM) : une touche joue toute la gamme, deux touches la gamme entre elles. Avec HOLD activé, rejouer la même note l’arrête.","k4edd58b9":"EDIT > WAVE, un mini éditeur de samples (d’après le ½ sampler) : l’onde sur tout l’écran avec IN, OUT, LOOP et TUNE sur les boutons.","k7ffaedeb":"Menu > SEQ : STEP ADVANCE, DRUM PREVIEW et FILTER RESO.","k9f2541ea":"Pour faire de la place, BASS, charleys et cymbales sont passés de 22 à 16 kHz et SCRATCH à 11 kHz. Aucun son n’a été supprimé.","k09955c94":"L’éditeur No Man Sky FM : l’éditeur SLOOP d’isod89 à notre nom et à nos couleurs. Morceaux, sons, piano roll, MIDI et sauvegardes depuis l’ordinateur.","k9cb995c1":"Tout le simulateur sur cette page : le modèle 3D, l’écran pixel pour pixel et les commandes côte à côte.","k2510c70d":"Six langues : anglais, portugais, coréen, japonais, allemand et français.","k06ace978":"La planète en 3D","k9af3f864":"Courses","k82510ca3":"CD","kb4e3efeb":"Son","k9629fc86":"Éditeur et site","k62cf05b6":"tourner le vaisseau","kf5e2b043":"zoom : large, proche, gros plan, cabine","k3a96d969":"le volume de la piste sélectionnée","k4d8edb7c":"le tempo","k0bd7625b":"boost (1,2 s : saut à impulsion)","kb716a492":"boost automatique (un autre clic : désactivé)","kad5ceaf9":"entrer sur une planète · s’amarrer · suivre le vaisseau au drapeau","k33b2ad58":"la carte de warp","k87c70a0b":"radar","k4823aacf":"HOME maintenu","k1dff73ec":"le menu","k73dad583":"vitesse (au maximum un instant : une course)","k5a64c49b":"atterrir (dans une course, encore : voler)","kdf06b147":"marcher","kea567fff":"courir · à l’arrêt : appeler le vaisseau","k8e7ca96b":"laser (relâcher : ramasser) · décoller près du vaisseau","k85eaed4f":"appeler le vaisseau","ka9ccbb94":"qui est sur scène","kfdb309c6":"le mini éditeur de samples","k88dd24ae":"SCL : la gamme à partir d’une ou deux touches","k7dd888f2":"STEP ADVANCE, DRUM PREVIEW, FILTER RESO","kcd92dc96":"la lumière d’une touche : vagues, pluie, comète, feux d’artifice","k8de073a2":"TUNE et DECAY d’un instrument de batterie","k66adecc9":"QUANT ON / OFF : enregistrer hors grille","k59d4f603":"Dans l’espace","k3ed10c21":"Au-dessus d’une planète","k39c7937a":"À pied","k97f44890":"Nouveaux écrans","ke27f466b":"Une aventure spatiale","k4576054d":"Allumez le FM-1 : votre vaisseau arrive au-dessus des étoiles, avec son propre thème synthwave. N’importe quel bouton le passe.","k975b6b23":"allumer","k2b8e1848":"l’intro, puis le jeu","kb093ecac":"Voler entre les planètes","k77256c5f":"Les planètes les plus proches attendent au bord de l’écran avec leur distance en années-lumière. Chacune est différente : couleurs, mers, collines, anneaux.","kecee81ec":"tourner, vitesse","k5954d15d":"boost, puis le saut à impulsion","k2803a730":"Zoomer, puis entrer","k43306160":"Zoomez sur votre vaisseau parmi de longues traînées de lumière, et encore une fois pour vous asseoir dans sa cabine.","k4430b15c":"large · proche · gros plan · cabine","kc2f4739c":"Warp vers d’autres étoiles","k07fcf2e1":"Ouvrez la carte galactique, choisissez un système et sautez : un tunnel de lumière, puis de nouvelles planètes.","kc0fa4797":"la carte","k271e9a56":"sauter","k60c56c36":"Vol tranquille","k8a247bf7":"Réglez le boost automatique, lancez une boucle douce, et volez, tout simplement.","k9aa61141":"boost automatique activé / désactivé","k5e0b5619":"Dans la planète","kb31ea7af":"Approchez-vous jusqu’à ce que l’anneau pointillé clignote et maintenez OCT+ : vous descendez en volant au-dessus de son sol, en 3D.","k7906058d":"entrer, puis atterrir","k7bf66fa8":"Robots, laser, butin","ka5eed2eb":"Marchez, minez au laser et combattez les sentinelles : trois coups et elles explosent. Certaines planètes sont hostiles et ripostent.","k71f8a623":"le laser (relâcher : ramasser)","k8cb31094":"Appeler le vaisseau, décoller","kd5011982":"Le vaisseau se pose près de vous. Près de lui, maintenez OCT+ : un film en pixel art vous emmène à travers les nuages, de retour dans l’espace.","k7c0ed89a":"décoller","kc42a2f1c":"Ils vous suivent","k8ea7fd1b":"Les robots que vous avez combattus vous suivent dans l’espace sous forme de vaisseaux rouges. Boostez assez fort et vous les semez.","k9bdf185f":"fuir en boostant","kbe41101b":"Course au-dessus de la planète","k5d8a5c15":"À pleine vitesse, quatre vaisseaux vous rejoignent : six faisceaux de lumière, des crédits selon votre place à l’arrivée.","k3333c386":"à fond","k56b2d3e1":"Le vaisseau au drapeau","ke208b11a":"De temps en temps, un pilote attend dans l’espace. Maintenez OCT+ près de lui pour la course sur route, et ensuite vous revenez là où vous étiez.","kde4bedce":"course","ke1df3f25":"Faire la bande-son","kda37506e":"Tout SLOOP est là : boucles, pas, batterie, effets. Le tout pendant que le voyage continue.","kc13440a0":"enregistrer une boucle","ka9e6fa99":"SEQ maintenu + touches","k6578912e":"pas","k5b1626c3":"FX maintenu + touche","k55ab2cbb":"un effet de performance","k1923752a":"Des sons en CD","k687533d1":"Changez de son et son CD arrive en roulant avec son nom dessus.","kfb866fad":"changer de son","k1b7d7165":"Chaque écran sur le jeu","kd114ea44":"Pages, couches, REC, le menu : le jeu reste derrière, à travers une trame sombre de pixels.","k98e91f6d":"n’importe quelle page","k7cbe8abe":"le jeu derrière","kf6d700f5":"Vol","kef23509a":"Planètes","k60384fa6":"Combats et courses","k131260cb":"Musique","kcbc8b5aa":"La planète en 3D, nouvelles courses, CD, SLOOP 2.8.4. Disponible.","kb346d4c1":"Vol au-dessus de chaque planète en 3D, sur le sol que vous foulez ; atterrissage sur terre, arbres qui explosent en pixels","kd883b9b4":"Course au-dessus de la planète avec quatre rivaux et six faisceaux ; un vaisseau à drapeau lance la course sur route dans l’espace","k9c33822b":"CD à chaque changement de son (d’après les cassettes de winampFM)","k69e0b472":"SLOOP 2.8.4 d’isod89 fusionné","kaa246f80":"PARTY et l’arpège de gamme (depuis winampFM)","k1d9920a3":"Écrans sur le jeu bien plus légers : seul ce qui change part vers le LCD","k66857ce2":"L’éditeur sur le site, tout le simulateur, six langues","k0fc1909a":"Retiré pour faire de la place : drapeaux de course sur les planètes, portes des stations, course néon dans l’espace. Fréquences d’échantillonnage réduites sur BASS, charleys, cymbales et SCRATCH","kbc6101e6":"Versions de test, jamais publiées.","k8cc090e9":"EDIT > WAVE, le mini éditeur de samples (d’après le ½ sampler)","k2303fd3b":"Une bande qui indique ce que font les quatre boutons, pendant deux secondes après un tour","k7cbfd71f":"Des points qui montrent la page où vous êtes","kcfd9dc35":"Couleurs de chaque piste dans les visuels","ka9feadb0":"La galaxie s’est animée.","kcfa1d2fa":"Batailles dans l’espace : un boss qui tire en rafales et tombe en 30 s, de petits vaisseaux qui n’arrêtent pas d’arriver","kba483788":"Des pirates attaquent le système de temps en temps : 2 à 6 vaisseaux","k0534a559":"Maintenez des touches pour appeler des escortes : de petits vaisseaux blancs aux longues traînées","ka64eda06":"Courses sur les planètes et sur une route néon dans l’espace, avec vitesses et tableau de bord en pixels","kb602be8b":"Un hangar dans chaque station : cinq vaisseaux, améliorations de moteur et d’armes","k7ddb9617":"Des gens sur certaines planètes avec des quêtes, des vaisseaux de passage qui vous parlent","k9b6081cd":"REC garde l’arpégiateur et les effets en punch-in, enregistrés avec le projet","kf79e460b":"Un nouveau décollage et un gros plan dessinés à partir d’un modèle 3D du vaisseau","k7bf542e0":"Première version publique : site, installateur, simulateur.","kc3db383f":"SLOOP 2.7.1 fusionné : le son sur les deux cœurs, 15 modes d’arp, KBD HOLD, MIDI 3, SAVE SECTION A–D, sons favoris, REC QUANT désactivé, samples utilisateur en boucle, accélération des boutons, fréquence audio USB","kd402a7c9":"KEY LED : la lumière d’une touche (depuis winampFM)","k912e556d":"GLO > DRUM SOUND : TUNE et DECAY d’un instrument de batterie","ke89ae343":"L’intro avec sa propre musique ; une nébuleuse derrière les étoiles ; des anneaux autour des planètes","kd95bd2f5":"Une galaxie à parcourir.","k96aba26f":"Carte galactique, warp, stations, commerce, carburant et parties sauvegardées","kd712bf1a":"Sentinelles sur les planètes, combat au laser, planètes hostiles, poursuite dans l’espace","k4f34c665":"Boost, saut à impulsion, boost automatique, radar, gros plan, cabine","k897fc7a2":"Des visuels derrière les boutons que vous tournez ; films de décollage et de warp","k147e5d86":"Le jeu sur HOME.","k8adacd22":"Un jeu spatial sur HOME, inspiré de Low Mem Sky (PICO-8) et de No Man’s Sky : étoiles, planètes globes, atterrissage, marche, ressources, créatures, scanner","k1b0aa9c3":"Quatre couleurs sur noir et blanc ; textures en pixels au lieu de texte inversé","kc767dde1":"La base.","k8064f8c8":"Construit sur SLOOP 2.6 d’isod89 (basé sur Felucca de Leo Kuroshita) : le même son et les mêmes boutons","k08d8c5e5":"Nouveaux écrans : noir et blanc, chiffres et barres seulement","kc7e9fb2e":"Éditeur","k77e39fce":"<b>Quêtes secondaires de la vraie vie</b><br>Mon espace personnel pour partager l’avancée de mes études en technologie : apprendre les synthés, améliorations et tests avec No Man Sky FM, winampFM et FM1 Quest, et prototypes de robotique avec ESP32.","k31168e75":"<b>Démos et mises à jour</b><br>Des vidéos des mises à jour de No Man Sky FM, winampFM et FM1 Quest en action, des guides de développement pour que plus de gens créent avec leur propre créativité, et quelques coulisses.","k36970242":"Nouveautés","k5d12bd53":"Jouer","kbee75ca7":"Commandes","kfc338f87":"Fonctionnalités","ka239107e":"Versions","k14e8617e":"Aide à l’installation","kcf04a7f5":"No Man Sky FM pour votre FM-1","ked4318b7":"Un firmware gratuit pour le M-VAVE FM-1 : une aventure spatiale que l’on joue avec deux boutons pendant que l’autre main fait la musique. Survolez des planètes, faites la course, minez, combattez, warpez entre les étoiles.","ka16e30a0":"basé sur SLOOP 2.8.4","kcce2664d":"Télécharger le fichier du firmware","kcd5af734":"Notes de version","kaeaf06e3":"Ouvrir l’éditeur","kb3782d9b":"Nouveau dans la v0.9","k30a2439c":"Encore en cours d’optimisation.","k2ea97e86":"Cette version apporte beaucoup de choses d’un coup, donc le vol 3D et certains écrans peuvent encore perdre des images, et d’autres optimisations arrivent dans les prochaines versions. Faites une sauvegarde et dites-nous ce qui vous semble lent.","kb23035c2":"Toute la musique de la vidéo a été faite en direct sur le FM-1, pendant que l’on jouait au jeu. Filmé sur une version antérieure.","k9856dddb":"Jouer ici","k64312600":"Le vrai firmware dans votre navigateur. Cliquez sur l’écran pour l’allumer, puis utilisez les boutons, les touches ou le clavier de votre ordinateur.","k4e787811":"Les commandes","ka38197a6":"Sur HOME, le FM-1 est le jeu.","kd1752358":"Un appui bref garde la fonction habituelle.","k66647c2c":"Seuls le maintien, le double appui ou l’appui simultané font quelque chose de nouveau : un seul appui, OCT− et OCT+ changent toujours l’octave, et tous les autres boutons font ce qu’ils ont toujours fait sur SLOOP.","kca032b58":"Ce que ça fait","kd93e1cee":"Chaque clip est le vrai écran.","k7d0a579d":"Toutes les versions","ke2e004bd":"Ce que chacune a apporté.","ke29b98d8":"Installation : détails","k77340732":"Maintenez OCT− seul en allumant le FM-1 pour le secours USB.","k99b506be":"Journal d’installation","k2f388ccb":"No Man Sky FM est basé sur SLOOP 2.8.4 d’isod89, lui-même basé sur Felucca de Leo Kuroshita (Hügelton Instruments). GPL-3.0. Les cassettes, PARTY, l’arpège de gamme et KEY LED viennent de winampFM ; l’éditeur de samples suit le ½ sampler ; le jeu s’inspire de Low Mem Sky (PICO-8).","k6d21d709":"Le code source de tout le firmware est ouvert : utilisez les fonctionnalités dans vos propres projets, mentionnez simplement No Man Sky FM dans votre README ou votre vidéo.","kba54bb5f":"Un demake de fan inspiré de No Man’s Sky. Non affilié à Hello Games ni à M-VAVE. M-VAVE et FM-1 sont des marques de leurs propriétaires respectifs.","k7807532a":"Cookies et statistiques (Google Analytics)","kcd39008a":"Ce site n’utilise des cookies que pour Google Analytics (compter les visites et les clics). Rien n’est utilisé pour la publicité.","kbb54db51":"Accepter","kb59cf9ed":"Refuser","k273757aa":"No Man Sky FM · une aventure spatiale pour le M-VAVE FM-1","kc8675119":"No Man Sky FM : un firmware gratuit et expérimental pour le M-VAVE FM-1. Survolez des planètes en 3D, faites la course, atterrissez, minez, combattez, warpez entre les étoiles, et faites la bande-son de votre voyage.","s_title":"simulateur · le vrai firmware (WebAssembly)","s_on":"allumer","s_snd":"son","s_reset":"réinitialiser la mémoire","s_hint":"Cliquez sur l’écran pour allumer. Volez avec KNOB 1 et 2, maintenez OCT+ pour atterrir, jouez les touches pour faire la bande-son.","s_scr":"L’écran, pixel pour pixel","s_scrn":"La même image que sur la vitre du modèle : ce que le firmware dessine sur le LCD 240×240.","s_how":"Comment jouer","s_k12":"tourner le vaisseau · vitesse (sur une planète : marcher)","s_a":"boost · sur une planète : courir (à l’arrêt : appeler le vaisseau)","s_b":"entrer sur une planète · atterrir · laser · décoller près du vaisseau","s_map":"la carte de warp","s_oct":"l’octave, comme toujours","s_k34":"zoom (vers le gros plan et la cabine) · le volume de la piste","s_home":"radar · HOME maintenu : sur une planète le vaisseau, dans l’espace le menu","s_play":"la musique","s_keys":"jouer des notes","s_held":"Clic droit (ou Maj+clic) sur un bouton du modèle pour le garder maintenu.","s_clk":"CLIQUEZ POUR ALLUMER","s_pow":"ALLUMAGE…","s_ask":"Effacer la mémoire du simulateur et redémarrer ?","s_noM":"aucun appareil MIDI trouvé","s_arw":"flèches ↑↓ tourner","s_ohd":"OCT− maintenu","s_bhd":"OCT+ maintenu","s_ock":"clic OCT","s_kk":"touches"}};
window.NMS_INST={"ko":{"ready":"No Man Sky FM을 설치할 준비가 되었습니다 ","intro":"USB로 FM-1을 연결한 뒤 설치를 누르세요. Chrome 또는 Edge에서만 가능합니다 (Web MIDI).","warn":"쓰는 동안 USB 케이블을 뽑지 마세요.","install":"No Man Sky FM 설치","editor":"에디터 열기 (컴퓨터에서 백업하고 사운드와 시퀀스 편집)","direct":"USB 케이블을 컴퓨터에 직접 연결하세요. 프로브나 Transporter는 필요하지 않습니다.","brick":"설치에 실패해 FM-1이 더 이상 켜지지 않는 경우, 복구하려면 Transporter가 필요합니다:","beta":"No Man Sky FM은 실험적인 커스텀 펌웨어이며 불안정할 수 있습니다. 모든 기기에서 테스트된 것은 아닙니다. 이 펌웨어로 인해 FM-1이 손상되거나 오작동하더라도 제작자는 책임지지 않습니다. 본인의 책임하에 사용하시고, 먼저 백업을 저장하세요.","back":"M-VAVE의 공식 업데이터인 M-UPGRADE(Downloads → PC Software)도 사용할 수 있습니다. FM-1을 찾지 못하면 MIDI를 사용하는 다른 앱과 브라우저 탭을 모두 닫으세요.","nomidi":"이 브라우저에서는 할 수 없습니다. Chrome 또는 Edge에서 이 페이지를 여세요.","loadfail":"불러오지 못했습니다: ","start":"FM-1과 통신하는 중…","verify":"3단계 중 1단계 · No Man Sky FM을 FM-1로 보내 확인하는 중","loader":"3단계 중 2단계 · FM-1이 업데이트 모드로 다시 시작됩니다","write":"3단계 중 3단계 · No Man Sky FM을 쓰는 중. 케이블을 뽑지 마세요","reboot":"FM-1을 다시 시작하는 중…","done":"완료! No Man Sky FM이 설치되었습니다: ","stopped":"중단되었습니다. USB 케이블을 다시 꽂고 설치를 다시 누르세요.","error":"오류: ","denied":"MIDI(SysEx) 접근이 허용되지 않았습니다. 주소창의 사이트 설정에서 MIDI를 허용한 뒤 설치를 다시 누르세요.","notfound":"FM-1을 찾을 수 없습니다. USB 케이블(데이터 케이블)을 확인하고, MIDI를 사용하는 다른 앱을 닫은 뒤 설치를 다시 누르세요.","model":"연결된 기기가 FM-1이 아닙니다.","lost":"USB 연결이 끊어졌습니다. 다시 꽂고 설치를 다시 누르세요.","noloader":"업데이트 모드의 FM-1을 찾을 수 없습니다. USB 케이블을 다시 꽂고 설치를 다시 누르세요 (끝날 때까지 업데이트 모드로 유지됩니다).","noreturn":"FM-1이 돌아오지 않았습니다. 전원을 껐다 켜세요.","mismatch":"쓰기는 끝났지만 FM-1이 다른 버전을 보고합니다: ","foreign":"FM-1이 다른 펌웨어의 업데이트 모드에 있습니다. 해당 업데이터(M-UPGRADE)로 그 업데이트를 마친 뒤 설치를 다시 누르세요: ","badpkg":"설치할 파일이 손상되었습니다. 페이지를 새로고침하세요.","leave":"쓰는 중입니다. 페이지를 닫지 마세요.","license":"GPL-3.0, 보증 없음. 소스:","stockTitle":"공식 펌웨어(V15)로 되돌리기","stockHelp":"M-VAVE에서 공식 FM-1 V15를 내려받아 그 안의 FM-1.fwsc를 수정하지 않은 채 선택하세요. 파일은 이 브라우저에서 검사되며 어디로도 전송되지 않습니다.","stockBackup":"공식 펌웨어는 SLOOP / No Man Sky FM의 음악, 프로젝트, 샘플을 열 수 없습니다. 보관하려는 것은 먼저 적어 두거나 녹음해 두세요.","stockEditor":"에디터를 열어 백업","stockSaved":"이 컴퓨터에 백업을 저장했습니다","stockFile":"공식 FM-1.fwsc","stockGo":"공식 V15 설치","stockValid":"공식 V15 확인됨","stockBad":"공식 V15가 아닙니다: ","stockConfirm":"FM-1에 공식 V15를 설치할까요? 공식 펌웨어는 No Man Sky FM 음악을 열 수 없습니다. 백업을 저장했나요?","stockFinish":"FM-1이 SLOOP / No Man Sky FM의 업데이트 모드에 있습니다. 먼저 설치를 눌러 그 업데이트를 마친 뒤 공식 V15로 돌아가세요."},"ja":{"ready":"No Man Sky FMをインストールする準備ができました ","intro":"FM-1をUSBで接続してから、インストールを押してください。ChromeまたはEdgeのみ対応（Web MIDI）。","warn":"書き込み中はUSBケーブルを抜かないでください。","install":"No Man Sky FMをインストール","editor":"エディターを開く（バックアップや、パソコンからの音色・シーケンスの編集）","direct":"USBケーブルはパソコンに直接つないでください。プローブやTransporterは不要です。","brick":"インストールに失敗してFM-1が起動しなくなった場合、復旧にはTransporterが必要です：","beta":"No Man Sky FMは実験的なカスタムファームウェアで、動作が不安定になることがあります。すべての機器で試したわけではありません。これが原因でFM-1が故障したり不具合が出たりしても、作者は責任を負いません。自己責任でお使いください。先にバックアップを取ってください。","back":"M-VAVE公式のアップデーターM-UPGRADE（Downloads → PC Software）でも書き込めます。FM-1が見つからない場合は、MIDIを使っているほかのアプリとブラウザのタブをすべて閉じてください。","nomidi":"このブラウザでは使えません。ChromeまたはEdgeでページを開いてください。","loadfail":"読み込めませんでした: ","start":"FM-1と通信しています…","verify":"ステップ 1/3 · No Man Sky FMをFM-1に送って確認しています","loader":"ステップ 2/3 · FM-1がアップデートモードで再起動します","write":"ステップ 3/3 · No Man Sky FMを書き込んでいます。ケーブルを抜かないでください","reboot":"FM-1を再起動しています…","done":"完了です！No Man Sky FMがインストールされました: ","stopped":"中断しました。USBケーブルを挿し直して、もう一度インストールを押してください。","error":"エラー: ","denied":"MIDI（SysEx）へのアクセスが許可されませんでした。サイトの設定（アドレスバー）でMIDIを許可してから、もう一度インストールを押してください。","notfound":"FM-1が見つかりません。USBケーブル（データ通信対応のもの）を確認し、MIDIを使っているほかのアプリを閉じて、もう一度インストールを押してください。","model":"接続された機器はFM-1ではありません。","lost":"USB接続が切れました。挿し直して、もう一度インストールを押してください。","noloader":"アップデートモードのFM-1が見つかりません。USBケーブルを挿し直して、もう一度インストールを押してください（終わるまでアップデートモードのままです）。","noreturn":"FM-1が戻ってきませんでした。電源を入れ直してください。","mismatch":"書き込みは完了しましたが、FM-1が別のバージョンを報告しています: ","foreign":"FM-1は別のファームウェアのアップデートモードになっています。そのアップデーター（M-UPGRADE）でアップデートを完了してから、もう一度インストールを押してください: ","badpkg":"インストールするファイルが壊れています。ページを再読み込みしてください。","leave":"書き込み中です。ページを閉じないでください。","license":"GPL-3.0、無保証。ソース:","stockTitle":"公式ファームウェア（V15）に戻す","stockHelp":"M-VAVEから公式のFM-1 V15をダウンロードし、中のFM-1.fwscを変更せずに選んでください。ファイルはこのブラウザ内で検証され、どこにも送信されません。","stockBackup":"公式ファームウェアでは、SLOOP / No Man Sky FMの音楽、プロジェクト、サンプルを開けません。残したいものは先に書き留めるか録音してください。","stockEditor":"エディターを開いてバックアップ","stockSaved":"このパソコンにバックアップを保存しました","stockFile":"公式のFM-1.fwsc","stockGo":"公式V15をインストール","stockValid":"公式V15を確認しました","stockBad":"公式V15ではありません: ","stockConfirm":"FM-1に公式V15をインストールしますか？公式ファームウェアではNo Man Sky FMの音楽を開けません。バックアップは保存しましたか？","stockFinish":"FM-1はSLOOP / No Man Sky FMのアップデートモードになっています。まずインストールを押してそのアップデートを完了させてから、公式V15に戻してください。"},"de":{"ready":"Bereit, No Man Sky FM zu installieren ","intro":"Verbinde den FM-1 per USB und drücke dann Installieren. Nur Chrome oder Edge (Web MIDI).","warn":"Zieh das USB-Kabel nicht ab, solange geschrieben wird.","install":"No Man Sky FM installieren","editor":"Den Editor öffnen (Backup, Sounds und Sequenzen vom Computer aus bearbeiten)","direct":"Schließe das USB-Kabel direkt am Computer an. Du brauchst weder Probe noch Transporter.","brick":"Wenn eine Installation fehlschlägt und der FM-1 nicht mehr startet, brauchst du zur Wiederherstellung einen Transporter:","beta":"No Man Sky FM ist eine experimentelle Custom-Firmware und kann instabil sein. Sie wurde nicht auf jedem Gerät getestet. Die Autoren übernehmen keine Verantwortung, wenn dein FM-1 dadurch beschädigt wird oder sich seltsam verhält. Nutzung auf eigene Gefahr, und mach vorher ein Backup.","back":"Der eigene Updater von M-VAVE, M-UPGRADE (Downloads → PC Software), funktioniert ebenfalls. Wenn er den FM-1 nicht findet, schließe alle anderen Apps und Browser-Tabs, die MIDI nutzen.","nomidi":"Dieser Browser kann das nicht. Öffne die Seite in Chrome oder Edge.","loadfail":"Konnte nicht geladen werden: ","start":"Verbindung zum FM-1…","verify":"Schritt 1 von 3 · No Man Sky FM wird an den FM-1 gesendet und geprüft","loader":"Schritt 2 von 3 · der FM-1 startet im Update-Modus neu","write":"Schritt 3 von 3 · No Man Sky FM wird geschrieben. Zieh das Kabel nicht ab","reboot":"FM-1 wird neu gestartet…","done":"Fertig! No Man Sky FM ist installiert: ","stopped":"Gestoppt. Steck das USB-Kabel neu ein und drücke noch einmal Installieren.","error":"Fehler: ","denied":"Der MIDI-Zugriff (SysEx) wurde nicht erlaubt. Erlaube MIDI in den Website-Einstellungen (Adressleiste) und drücke noch einmal Installieren.","notfound":"FM-1 nicht gefunden. Prüfe das USB-Kabel (ein Datenkabel), schließe andere Apps, die MIDI nutzen, und drücke noch einmal Installieren.","model":"Das angeschlossene Gerät ist kein FM-1.","lost":"Die USB-Verbindung ist abgebrochen. Steck das Kabel neu ein und drücke noch einmal Installieren.","noloader":"Der FM-1 im Update-Modus wurde nicht gefunden. Steck das USB-Kabel neu ein und drücke noch einmal Installieren (er bleibt im Update-Modus, bis er fertig ist).","noreturn":"Der FM-1 ist nicht zurückgekommen. Schalte ihn aus und wieder ein.","mismatch":"Geschrieben, aber der FM-1 meldet eine andere Version: ","foreign":"Der FM-1 ist im Update-Modus einer anderen Firmware. Beende dieses Update mit dem zugehörigen Updater (M-UPGRADE) und drücke dann noch einmal Installieren: ","badpkg":"Die zu installierende Datei ist beschädigt. Lade die Seite neu.","leave":"Es wird geschrieben. Schließe die Seite nicht.","license":"GPL-3.0, ohne Gewährleistung. Quellcode:","stockTitle":"Zurück zur offiziellen Firmware (V15)","stockHelp":"Lade die offizielle FM-1 V15 von M-VAVE herunter und wähle darin die unveränderte FM-1.fwsc. Die Datei wird in diesem Browser geprüft und nirgendwohin gesendet.","stockBackup":"Die offizielle Firmware kann keine SLOOP- / No Man Sky FM-Musik, -Projekte oder -Samples öffnen. Notiere oder nimm vorher auf, was du behalten willst.","stockEditor":"Editor für das Backup öffnen","stockSaved":"Ich habe ein Backup auf diesem Computer gespeichert","stockFile":"Die offizielle FM-1.fwsc","stockGo":"Offizielle V15 installieren","stockValid":"Offizielle V15 geprüft","stockBad":"Nicht die offizielle V15: ","stockConfirm":"Die offizielle V15 auf dem FM-1 installieren? Die offizielle Firmware kann keine No Man Sky FM-Musik öffnen. Hast du ein Backup gespeichert?","stockFinish":"Der FM-1 ist im Update-Modus von SLOOP / No Man Sky FM. Drücke Installieren, um dieses Update zuerst abzuschließen, und kehre dann zur offiziellen V15 zurück."},"fr":{"ready":"Prêt à installer No Man Sky FM ","intro":"Branchez le FM-1 en USB, puis appuyez sur Installer. Chrome ou Edge uniquement (Web MIDI).","warn":"Ne débranchez pas le câble USB pendant l’écriture.","install":"Installer No Man Sky FM","editor":"Ouvrir l’éditeur (sauvegarder, modifier sons et séquences depuis l’ordinateur)","direct":"Branchez le câble USB directement à l’ordinateur. Aucune sonde ni Transporter n’est nécessaire.","brick":"Si une installation échoue et que le FM-1 ne démarre plus, il faut un Transporter pour le récupérer :","beta":"No Man Sky FM est un firmware personnalisé expérimental et peut être instable. Il n’a pas été essayé sur tous les appareils. Les auteurs déclinent toute responsabilité si votre FM-1 est endommagé ou se comporte mal à cause de lui. Utilisez-le à vos risques et faites d’abord une sauvegarde.","back":"L’outil de mise à jour de M-VAVE, M-UPGRADE (Downloads → PC Software), fonctionne aussi. S’il ne trouve pas le FM-1, fermez toutes les autres applications et tous les onglets du navigateur qui utilisent le MIDI.","nomidi":"Ce navigateur ne peut pas le faire. Ouvrez la page dans Chrome ou Edge.","loadfail":"Chargement impossible : ","start":"Communication avec le FM-1…","verify":"Étape 1 sur 3 · envoi de No Man Sky FM au FM-1 et vérification","loader":"Étape 2 sur 3 · le FM-1 redémarre en mode mise à jour","write":"Étape 3 sur 3 · écriture de No Man Sky FM. Ne débranchez pas le câble","reboot":"Redémarrage du FM-1…","done":"Terminé ! No Man Sky FM est installé : ","stopped":"Arrêté. Rebranchez le câble USB et appuyez de nouveau sur Installer.","error":"Erreur : ","denied":"L’accès MIDI (SysEx) n’a pas été autorisé. Autorisez le MIDI dans les réglages du site (barre d’adresse) et appuyez de nouveau sur Installer.","notfound":"FM-1 introuvable. Vérifiez le câble USB (un câble de données), fermez les autres applications qui utilisent le MIDI et appuyez de nouveau sur Installer.","model":"L’appareil connecté n’est pas un FM-1.","lost":"La connexion USB a été perdue. Rebranchez-la et appuyez de nouveau sur Installer.","noloader":"Le FM-1 en mode mise à jour est introuvable. Rebranchez le câble USB et appuyez de nouveau sur Installer (il reste en mode mise à jour jusqu’à la fin).","noreturn":"Le FM-1 n’est pas revenu. Éteignez-le puis rallumez-le.","mismatch":"Écrit, mais le FM-1 indique une autre version : ","foreign":"Le FM-1 est en mode mise à jour d’un autre firmware. Terminez cette mise à jour avec son propre outil (M-UPGRADE), puis appuyez de nouveau sur Installer : ","badpkg":"Le fichier à installer est endommagé. Rechargez la page.","leave":"Écriture en cours. Ne fermez pas la page.","license":"GPL-3.0, sans garantie. Source :","stockTitle":"Revenir au firmware officiel (V15)","stockHelp":"Téléchargez le FM-1 V15 officiel chez M-VAVE et sélectionnez le FM-1.fwsc qu’il contient, non modifié. Le fichier est vérifié dans ce navigateur ; il n’est envoyé nulle part.","stockBackup":"Le firmware officiel ne peut pas ouvrir les morceaux, projets ou samples de SLOOP / No Man Sky FM. Notez ou enregistrez d’abord ce que vous voulez garder.","stockEditor":"Ouvrir l’éditeur pour sauvegarder","stockSaved":"J’ai fait une sauvegarde sur cet ordinateur","stockFile":"Le FM-1.fwsc officiel","stockGo":"Installer le V15 officiel","stockValid":"V15 officiel vérifié","stockBad":"Ce n’est pas le V15 officiel : ","stockConfirm":"Installer le V15 officiel sur le FM-1 ? Le firmware officiel ne peut pas ouvrir la musique de No Man Sky FM. Avez-vous fait une sauvegarde ?","stockFinish":"Le FM-1 est en mode mise à jour de SLOOP / No Man Sky FM. Appuyez sur Installer pour terminer d’abord cette mise à jour, puis revenez au V15 officiel."}};
